WEBVTT

asr-000001
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.120
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: From the minority, Honorable Iris Montes.

asr-000002
00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:12.540
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Thank you, Mr. Chair. Good afternoon, Secretary Vins, to the DPWH family and sa atin pong lahat.

asr-000003
00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:22.380
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Mr. Secretary, almost two years ago, your appointment came on the heels of a massive corruption scandal in the agency.

asr-000004
00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:30.680
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Marami po ang nabigyan ng pag-asa na maibabalik niyo po ang tiwala at kumpiyansa ng taong bayan.

asr-000005
00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:42.440
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Let me take off from the last words of your presentation about your commitment to protecting people's money and building the right infrastructure.

asr-000006
00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:52.400
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: But before that, let me first commend you for trying your best to institute reforms in the agency.

asr-000007
00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:54.820
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Especially in terms of technical reforms.

asr-000008
00:00:54.820 --> 00:01:01.520
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: However, I would like to delve more into financial accountability, transparency, and corruption.

asr-000009
00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:08.420
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Nabanggit niyo po kanina may portal, may nagtanong, nabanggit niyo po may portal ang DPWH.

asr-000010
00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:13.060
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Nabanggit niyo rin po na may i-upload kayong mga requirements for projects.

asr-000011
00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:19.120
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Can you briefly explain to me what is this portal all about?

asr-000012
00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:23.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Thank you po so much, ma'am.

asr-000013
00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:23.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: No.

asr-000014
00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:31.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Noong pong November of last year, nag-launch po si Pangulo nung Transparency Portal po ng DPWH.

asr-000015
00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:49.400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ito po ay isang website kung saan in-upload po ng DPWH ang lahat ng mga dokumento pertaining to both completed and ongoing projects over the last 10 years.

asr-000016
00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:53.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ito po ay naging follow-up dun sa isumbong ko.

asr-000017
00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:57.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: sa Pangulo website na ni-launch din po ng Pangulo a few months earlier.

asr-000018
00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:14.840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And that has been there for the public, for everyone po, including the media, to look at the projects of DPWH and look at all the documents supporting those projects.

asr-000019
00:02:14.840 --> 00:02:25.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So ngayon po, ito pong portal na ito, ito din po ang gagamitin namin para naman po i-upload.

asr-000021
00:02:25.260 --> 00:02:32.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: yung lahat ng detalye po dito sa 2027 Proposed National Expenditure Program ng DPWH.

asr-000022
00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:42.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And this will include all the supporting documentation for the 11,000 plus projects po of the department.

asr-000023
00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:45.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So yun po, yun po yung ano.

asr-000024
00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:48.980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And it's transparency.dpwh.gov.ph.

asr-000025
00:02:49.860 --> 00:02:52.140
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: So it is the initiative of the president.

asr-000026
00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:54.180
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: It is not from the DPWH.

asr-000027
00:02:54.280 --> 00:02:57.740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: It is from the DPWH po, but upon the instructions given by the president.

asr-000028
00:02:57.800 --> 00:03:02.020
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: So it's being institutionalized now in the DPWH.

asr-000029
00:03:02.020 --> 00:03:03.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yes po, starting last November.

asr-000030
00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:08.440
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: So what do we find in that, yung mga projects, requirements and all?

asr-000031
00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:23.560
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Pag paumanhin niyo po sana, Mr. Secretary, hindi ko po alam ang lahat, pero to my mind, parang maganda po na meron tayo dyan, na ipapakita natin ang proyekto, yung mga requirements.

asr-000032
00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:33.480
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Pero hindi po kaya mas magandang kumplituhin natin yung life cycle ng proyekto, di po ba, from start to finish, and even after completion,

asr-000033
00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:41.160
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: pwede po bang nasa plano po ba ng DPWH na i-institutionalize sa portal na yan?

asr-000034
00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:46.600
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Halimbawa po, yung sa procurement and bidding transparency, naka-livestream ba? Pwede ba?

asr-000035
00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:49.840
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Meron bang complete bidding documents na naka-upload?

asr-000036
00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:53.760
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: So, pangalawa po, real-time project monitoring.

asr-000037
00:03:55.020 --> 00:04:08.400
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Kasi yung real-time project monitoring, mabibigyan ng publiko, ang auditors, at mga stakeholders ng unrestricted access doon po sa portal na yun, at makikita nila ang nangyayari sa proyekto.

asr-000038
00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:14.520
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Meron dyan GIS map, may project location, GU tag photos, et cetera, et cetera.

asr-000039
00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:22.740
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: And in terms number three po, financial accountability naman, makikita natin yung budget versus actual cost.

asr-000040
00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:28.220
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Pag merong delay, merong change order logs, di po ba, may mga disbursement records.

asr-000041
00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:35.540
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: And then, yung pang-apat at pinaka-importante po para sa akin, yung contractor and citizen feedback loops.

asr-000042
00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:45.100
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Dapat nakikita natin yung contractor performance ratings doon, may public and grievance button, di po ba, for reporting.

asr-000043
00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:53.300
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: At meron din parang FOI, Freedom of Information Log, na na-view ng public everything about the project.

asr-000044
00:04:53.540 --> 00:05:03.560
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: So, if we want to talk about transparency, and if we want to talk about curbing corruption, I think, yung ganito pong pamamaraan is a step towards that direction.

asr-000045
00:05:03.560 --> 00:05:06.440
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Do you agree, and do you believe in that, Mr. Secretary?

asr-000046
00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:10.000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Absolutely, Mr. Chairman, Madam Congresswoman.

asr-000047
00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:17.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Actually po, most of the functionalities that you have mentioned, nandun na po sa portal, if I may give some of them.

asr-000048
00:05:17.140 --> 00:05:21.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: For example, from the bidding of the project,

asr-000049
00:05:22.240 --> 00:05:29.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: nandun po yung live stream nung mga proyekto, especially all ongoing, ano po yan, no?

asr-000050
00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:39.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nandun po yung live stream on the day of the bidding itself, plus the video is actually saved in the portal itself, number one.

asr-000051
00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:44.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Number two po, there is also project monitoring part of the portal.

asr-000052
00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:51.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: There are updates po on physical progress of the project using satellite imaging.

asr-000053
00:05:51.340 --> 00:05:52.740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: In fact, we signed.

asr-000054
00:05:52.740 --> 00:06:11.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: We signed po with the Philippine Space Agency to provide us with satellite images every, I think, every quarter para po makikita yung diferensya nung pag-umpisa ng project habang ginagawa po yung proyekto every three months.

asr-000055
00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:19.640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Meron din pong ano yan, lahat po ng bidding documents nandyan, and meron din pong running physical accomplishment, no?

asr-000056
00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:22.660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang wala lang po sa mga na-mention nyo.

asr-000057
00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:27.160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Which, tama po yung sinabi nyo, kailangan ilagay din is yung disbursement.

asr-000058
00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:32.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi ngayon po, ang meron lang is yung kapag fully paid na siya, no?

asr-000059
00:06:32.860 --> 00:06:37.220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero wala po yung progress billing, which I think we should also include there.

asr-000060
00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:40.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: But that won't be difficult, I think, to include in the portal.

asr-000061
00:06:40.760 --> 00:06:43.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: But many of the functionalities po you mentioned are there already.

asr-000062
00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:47.960
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Secretary.

asr-000063
00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:51.600
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Yun lamang po ang aking tanungan at paglilinaw.

asr-000064
00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:54.060
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: And I am hoping during the next...

asr-000065
00:06:54.060 --> 00:07:03.680
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: budget hearing next year, meron na rin po, umaasa po ako na magkakaroon na kayo ng report tungkol sa portal na po na ito po.

asr-000066
00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:11.860
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Kung ano ang nagawa to curb corruption in the agency, kung paano po napabuti ang ahensya,

asr-000067
00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:17.300
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: at kung paano nga po natin tunay na naprotektahan ang pera ng taong bayan.

asr-000068
00:07:17.400 --> 00:07:19.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Maraming salamat po, ma'am

asr-000069
00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:23.900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And but I don't think we have to wait po, ma'am, for next budget hearing, I think.

asr-000070
00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:32.100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: We owe it to Congress and the people that we give maybe a regular quarterly report from now until next year.

asr-000071
00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:33.460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: We will do that po, ma'am.

asr-000072
00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:34.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Thank you very much po.

asr-000073
00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:35.320
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, Secretary.

asr-000074
00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:36.360
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, Kong Iris.

asr-000075
00:07:36.900 --> 00:07:43.940
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: The next to interpolate is from the majority, and this time it's Honorable Salvalero Plato.

asr-000076
00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:51.580
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Next is Honorable Rufus Rodriguez.

asr-000077
00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:54.960
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

asr-000078
00:07:54.960 --> 00:08:04.200
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Welcome to Secretary Vince Dizon, our undersecretaries, assistant secretaries, directors, and the officialdom of the DPWH.

asr-000079
00:08:04.200 --> 00:08:07.700
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Let me first thank the Honorable Secretary.

asr-000080
00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:13.580
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Upon the request of the President, President Ferdinand Bongbong Marcos, Jr.,

asr-000081
00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:24.540
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: the Secretary went to Cagayan de Oro last Thursday and was able, therefore, to see our number one bypass project,

asr-000082
00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:27.300
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: the Cagayan de Oro Coastal Bypass Road.

asr-000083
00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:34.120
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: The last time a Secretary came to visit that project, because we finished Phase 1 already, nine years.

asr-000084
00:08:34.340 --> 00:08:44.520
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And we are now in the second phase of the CDO, 14 years after Secretary Vince Dizon came there to see that project, 2012,

asr-000085
00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:49.980
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: the next Secretary who came to Cagayan de Oro, Secretary Vince, thank you so much.

asr-000086
00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:52.140
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: On behalf of our people, we thank you.

asr-000087
00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:53.590
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: It was

asr-000088
00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:59.960
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: This is a good 14 years that a Secretary came to see our CDO Coastal Bypass Road

asr-000089
00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:09.400
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And thank you for stating that you are going to seek for, because it needs 34 billion pesos, you are going to secure foreign funding.

asr-000090
00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:10.620
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you so much.

asr-000091
00:09:10.620 --> 00:09:14.540
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Secondly, we also visited the other bypass road.

asr-000092
00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:21.780
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: If this is the highway, the only highway, diyan kami na sa traffic lot, this is the sea, you also have our eastern interior road.

asr-000093
00:09:21.940 --> 00:09:23.550
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: It only needs about seven billion.

asr-000094
00:09:23.760 --> 00:09:28.940
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And so you committed also to help, so that it will ease the traffic of our city.

asr-000095
00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:36.940
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And third, you have promised that you are going to add 120 million to finish our Makabalan-Bonbon Bridge,

asr-000096
00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:46.400
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: again, easing the traffic from the second district, which is my district, to the first district of the City of Golden Friendship, Cagayan de Oro.

asr-000097
00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:47.120
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you.

asr-000098
00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:49.060
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Next, I would like to thank you.

asr-000099
00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:53.460
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: You see, for the past two congresses, six years na.

asr-000100
00:09:53.590 --> 00:10:02.400
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: I've been filing a bill for the feasibility study of the Mindanao-Leite Bridge Interlink Project.

asr-000101
00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:08.600
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: During the BICAM, last December, with our minority leader, we were in the BICAM.

asr-000102
00:10:08.900 --> 00:10:15.500
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And there was no budget for 2026 for the Visayas to Sorsogon.

asr-000103
00:10:15.720 --> 00:10:21.840
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And we were able, in that BICAM, we were able, Mr. Secretary, to include 120.

asr-000104
00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:24.740
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And now you're implementing it for 2026.

asr-000105
00:10:24.740 --> 00:10:33.760
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And now, because of your magnanimous approach and the President, you have included now, for the first time,

asr-000106
00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:39.320
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: after six years of our trying to have this, including Chairman Momo,

asr-000107
00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:45.920
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: because this Surigao to Southern Leyte Bridge will go to Dilagat, his proposal,

asr-000108
00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:49.900
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: we received 350 million.

asr-000109
00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:53.540
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And that is why we hope that this will be implemented.

asr-000110
00:10:53.590 --> 00:11:02.640
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: It will be implemented soonest for January next year, so that once the study is finished in Visayas to Luzon,

asr-000111
00:11:02.820 --> 00:11:05.880
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: then the next will be Mindanao to Visayas.

asr-000112
00:11:05.880 --> 00:11:17.360
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And Mr. Secretary, this will revolutionize the economic development and social development of Mindanao, the Visayas, and then going to Luzon.

asr-000113
00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:19.080
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Everything will be seamless.

asr-000114
00:11:19.640 --> 00:11:22.860
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Food, food, food products, everything, merchandise.

asr-000115
00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:35.680
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: People will come, will go by car, by truck, from Mindanao, like Cagayan, Oro City, going to Surigao, going to Southern Leyte, going to Samar, Northern Samar, Sorsogon, and then to Manila.

asr-000116
00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:37.920
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you very much, Mr. Chairman, Mr. Secretary.

asr-000117
00:11:38.520 --> 00:11:41.780
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And finally, just small request.

asr-000118
00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:43.860
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Very, very small.

asr-000119
00:11:44.080 --> 00:11:44.740
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Two items.

asr-000120
00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:47.020
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And I have this letter to be given to you.

asr-000121
00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:49.620
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: The Pilay Sports Complex.

asr-000122
00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:52.320
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: This is where the Palarumpa Masa before.

asr-000123
00:11:52.930 --> 00:11:54.480
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: It's already dilapidated.

asr-000124
00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:56.060
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: It's 56 years old.

asr-000125
00:11:56.140 --> 00:12:05.100
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: I was looking at your presentation that the renovation of buildings are important.

asr-000126
00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:07.660
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So we're only asking 100 million only.

asr-000127
00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:08.200
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Why?

asr-000128
00:12:08.340 --> 00:12:17.860
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Because there is an agreement between, I was the one who called it, between the provincial governor, Juliet Uy, the mayor of Cagayan, Oro, Clarix Uy, and then this representation.

asr-000129
00:12:18.180 --> 00:12:22.440
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: We will start with renovating 300,000, 300 million.

asr-000130
00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:34.360
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: 100 million from the city, 100 million from the province, and 100 million from the DPWH, your department secretary, to be able to add to the grandstand and revise that.

asr-000131
00:12:34.360 --> 00:12:35.360
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So 100 million only.

asr-000132
00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:45.340
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And lastly, I would like to therefore ask for the another 200 million for our elevated skyway, walkway, walkway

asr-000133
00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:48.420
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Hindi lang ang Makati may elevated walkway.

asr-000134
00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:49.940
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Cagayan, the Oro will have one.

asr-000135
00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:52.640
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And that is because you have given us.

asr-000136
00:12:52.640 --> 00:13:05.100
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: This year, 83 million, and you are, we are asking for 200 million just to be able to get one-third of that because the amount needed, Mr. Secretary, is 570 million.

asr-000137
00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:06.440
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So just 200 million.

asr-000138
00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:07.760
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So I have here the letter.

asr-000139
00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:10.260
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: I'll ask Attorney Kenny DeChavez to give this.

asr-000140
00:13:10.340 --> 00:13:11.160
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Is Mitch around?

asr-000141
00:13:11.740 --> 00:13:12.500
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And Shane?

asr-000142
00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:13.620
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Yeah.

asr-000143
00:13:13.740 --> 00:13:14.660
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Please give this.

asr-000144
00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:21.100
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And therefore, with that, Mr. Chairman, again, the people of Cagayan, the Oro

asr-000145
00:13:21.100 --> 00:13:29.560
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you so much because of what you are doing and the President for the development of infrastructure in Cagayan, the Oro.

asr-000146
00:13:29.560 --> 00:13:38.560
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And I am here to therefore support, Mr. Chairman, to support the budget of DPWH and move for its increase.

asr-000147
00:13:40.020 --> 00:13:41.780
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Is there anything to increase?

asr-000148
00:13:43.240 --> 00:13:44.220
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Oh, yes daw.

asr-000149
00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:51.960
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: si Jeffrey, increase it because we're increasing other departments and you deserve more because you're doing everything.

asr-000151
00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:54.140
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Let's hear from the Secretary.

asr-000152
00:13:56.240 --> 00:13:58.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Thank you very much, Mr. Chairman.

asr-000153
00:13:59.140 --> 00:14:01.140
