asr-001895
01:30:32.220 --> 01:30:42.240
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: And what that presentation does is statutorily earmarked special fund.

asr-001896
01:30:43.800 --> 01:30:57.580
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: Mr. Secretary, in the fiscal year 2026, and even in the previous years, the special road fund appeared as a stand-alone PAP or program activity and project.

asr-001897
01:30:57.580 --> 01:31:11.750
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: Under the DPWH Convergence and Special Support Program, entitled Special Road Fund Motor Vehicles User Charge with a peso amount of 14, ito yung 2026,

asr-001898
01:31:11.750 --> 01:31:15.600
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: 14,833,952,000.

asr-001899
01:31:16.420 --> 01:31:24.320
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: In the fiscal year 2027 NEP, the same line item, a stand-alone PAP, is no longer there.

asr-001900
01:31:24.320 --> 01:31:30.140
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: The fiscal year 2026 GAA Special Provision was titled Special Road Fund.

asr-001901
01:31:30.140 --> 01:31:40.220
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: The fiscal year 2027-NEP Special Provision No. 10 is now titled Disposition of the Motor Vehicles Users Charge Collection.

asr-001902
01:31:40.220 --> 01:31:43.760
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: The title of the provision was changed.

asr-001903
01:31:47.260 --> 01:32:01.360
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: And the 15 billion that used to be a stand-alone Special Road Fund is now, for Special Provision No. 10, is specifically included under the Asset Preservation Program.

asr-001904
01:32:02.240 --> 01:32:16.480
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: So on the face of the fiscal year 2027-NEP, in the PAP schedule that this committee is being asked to approve, a legislator cannot see the Special Road Fund as a separate line.

asr-001907
01:32:16.820 --> 01:32:27.960
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: It is invisible unless one reads Special Provision No. 10 and knows how to look for it inside the Asset Preservation Program.

asr-001908
01:32:28.000 --> 01:32:30.480
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: Am I correct, Mr. Secretary?

asr-001909
01:32:31.280 --> 01:32:41.280
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: And may I add just a question, did the DPWH requested this provision or was it imposed upon you by the DBM?

asr-001910
