DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: May I ask our Undersecretary for planning, with the indulgence of our Honorable Congressman from Davao City, Undersecretary Nick Conte, to respond.

asr-001913
01:33:13.040 --> 01:33:17.600
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: Thank you, Mr. Chair, and maraming salamat po, Congressman, for that question.

asr-001914
01:33:17.980 --> 01:33:20.740
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: Tama po kayo. In the previous years, itemized po yung MVUC.

asr-001915
01:33:21.840 --> 01:33:25.360
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: But for this year, following yung amendment,

asr-001916
