DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: But for this year, following yung amendment nga po ng Republic Act 8794 by Republic Act 11239,

asr-001917
01:33:31.080 --> 01:33:41.980
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: kung saan na-limit na po yung gamit ng MVUC dito po sa Construction, Upgrading, Repair, and Rehabilitation of Roads, Bridges, and Road Drainage.

asr-001918
01:33:42.460 --> 01:33:49.940
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: So, ang ginawa po dito, by attribution, meaning there are projects in the Asset Under Organizational Outcome No. 1

asr-001919
01:33:50.760 --> 01:33:57.760
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: on Asset Preservation for Construction, Upgrading, Repair, and Rehabilitation of Roads, Bridges, and Road Drainage.

asr-001920
01:33:57.760 --> 01:34:05.880
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: which are actually attributed po yung magiging source po, Mr. Chairman, Honorable Congressman,

asr-001921
01:34:05.960 --> 01:34:13.080
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: galing po doon sa MBUC, which are collections that should be remitted to the Treasury under a special account in the General Fund.

asr-001922
