DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: kung saan po naka-attribute yung pondo po na yun under Organizational Outcome No. 1 to address the issue of visibility,

asr-001924
01:34:25.400 --> 01:34:26.200
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: hindi nyo nakikita.

asr-001925
01:34:26.200 --> 01:34:35.140
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: we have and we can furnish po the committee of the list of the projects under, again, Asset Preservation Organizational Outcome No. 1

asr-001926
01:34:35.160 --> 01:34:45.680
DPWH Undersecretary Nicasio A. Conti: amounting to the amount which was specified by the DBM, amounting to P15 billion for the year 2027 po, Mr. Chairman, Honorable Congressman.

