Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: Let me continue my question on Special Provision No. 10.

asr-001928
01:34:50.640 --> 01:34:54.720
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: Mr. Secretary, would you agree that the Special Road Fund is a special fund?

asr-001929
01:34:54.720 --> 01:34:59.660
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: Within the meaning of Article 6, Section 29, Paragraph 3 of the Constitution,

asr-001930
01:35:00.640 --> 01:35:08.580
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: there is money collected on tax levied for a special purpose to be treated as a special fund and paid out for such purpose only.

asr-001931
01:35:08.580 --> 01:35:17.420
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: And the Asset Preservation Program, on the other hand, is a regular DPWH program funded.

asr-001932
01:35:18.597 --> 01:35:21.652
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: Your Honor, I think this is a very important question

asr-001933
