Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: The MVUC amount.

asr-001945
01:36:25.060 --> 01:36:28.660
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: Is that not a narrowing of the operative use of the statutorily earmarked?

asr-001946
01:36:29.840 --> 01:36:32.880
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: So, deritsuhin ko na lang. Taposin ko na lang yung question ko.

asr-001947
01:36:33.140 --> 01:36:41.300
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: Now, Special Provision No. 10 requires the DPWH to disaggregate the Asset Preservation Program

asr-001948
