Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: from the effectivity of the GAA.

asr-001950
01:36:54.860 --> 01:37:00.240
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: That report is submitted after the GAA is approved and takes effect.

asr-001951
01:37:00.240 --> 01:37:08.560
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: It cannot inform this committee's deliberations on the 2027 appropriation because it does not yet exist when we vote.

asr-001952
01:37:09.320 --> 01:37:20.740
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: Instead, the Special Road Fund were carried away as a separate PAP line on the face of the enacted GAAH as it was in the 2024, 2025, and 2026.

asr-001953
01:37:21.160 --> 01:37:25.200
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: Then, the 15 billion MVUC amount would be visible to this committee.

asr-001954
01:37:25.200 --> 01:37:34.920
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: At that time, the amount would be visible to the committee at the time of enactment and, of course, during deliberation.

asr-001955
01:37:35.560 --> 01:37:44.600
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: And the 15-day post-effectivity disaggregation would not be necessary at all because the fund would already be separately visible in the GAA.

asr-001956
01:37:45.100 --> 01:37:54.000
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: how we retained the previous stand-alone PAP for Special Road Fund.

asr-001957
01:37:54.000 --> 01:38:03.400
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: So, the 15-day disaggregation, again, and the 15-day post-effectivity disaggregation report would not be necessary at all

asr-001958
01:38:03.400 --> 01:38:10.680
