asr-001959
01:38:11.580 --> 01:38:18.600
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: So, the 15-day disaggregation requirement in the Special Provision No. 10, in effect, is a workaround for a problem later on.

asr-001960
01:38:18.740 --> 01:38:21.860
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: It's self-creating by removing the stand-alone PAP.

asr-001962
01:38:21.860 --> 01:38:31.100
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: Let me emphasize that post-enactment project identification has already been struck down by the Supreme Court.

asr-001963
01:38:31.300 --> 01:38:32.440
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Last 10 seconds.

asr-001964
01:38:36.520 --> 01:38:51.180
