asr-001967
01:39:06.020 --> 01:39:14.720
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: and the UIGF, use of income in the general fund, which includes the Special Road Fund.

asr-001968
01:39:15.140 --> 01:39:20.940
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: And the Supreme Court has already heard oral arguments five times.

asr-001969
01:39:21.180 --> 01:39:25.520
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: So, I think everybody of us here knows.

asr-001970
01:39:25.520 --> 01:39:41.260
Rep. Isidro T. Ungab: That there are several cases already ruled that a General Appropriations Act, which is a general law, cannot amend a special law, which is the MVUC and its amended version.

asr-001971
01:39:41.680 --> 01:39:42.860
