DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi yan po, long term po talagang

asr-003449
02:40:17.860 --> 02:40:18.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: makakatulong

asr-003450
02:40:18.300 --> 02:40:18.860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ng malaki.

asr-003451
02:40:20.620 --> 02:40:21.820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Multiple areas po yan.

asr-003452
02:40:22.120 --> 02:40:23.820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Southern Metro Manila,

asr-003453
02:40:23.980 --> 02:40:25.360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Laguna at Cavite.

asr-003454
02:40:26.080 --> 02:40:27.000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Matutulungan po nga.

asr-003455
02:40:28.720 --> 02:40:29.240
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Salamat, Sec.

asr-003456
02:40:30.280 --> 02:40:31.920
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Siguro mga panghuling tanong na lang.

asr-003457
02:40:32.080 --> 02:40:34.120
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Yung doon sa mga water detention facilities.

asr-003458
02:40:34.760 --> 02:40:36.680
Rep. Brian Raymund S. Yamsuan: Kasi diba nakita mo noong dumalaw tayo

asr-003459
