DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kasama na rin po ang Northern Samar.

asr-004080
03:18:10.780 --> 03:18:14.820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At talaga pong grabe po talaga ang sitwasyon doon.

asr-004081
03:18:14.860 --> 03:18:15.600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero tingin ko po, unang-una,

asr-004082
03:18:17.180 --> 03:18:18.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: dalawang bagay.

asr-004083
03:18:18.800 --> 03:18:20.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Unang-una, kailangan ma-plano nang maigi.

asr-004084
03:18:21.800 --> 03:18:24.900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nandito po si Congresswoman Deth Escudero.

asr-004085
03:18:25.180 --> 03:18:28.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kung titignan po natin ang Marica Highway segment ng Sorsogon,

asr-004086
03:18:28.400 --> 03:18:30.020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: napakaayos po.

asr-004087
03:18:30.960 --> 03:18:32.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dinaanan ko din po yan.

asr-004088
03:18:32.140 --> 03:18:34.860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At yan po, talagang pinag-plano ng tama,

asr-004089
03:18:35.120 --> 03:18:36.460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kinonstruct ng tama.

asr-004090
03:18:36.720 --> 03:18:39.240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So tingin ko po, unang-una, kailangan planuhin ng tama.

asr-004091
03:18:39.240 --> 03:18:42.200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dahil marami pong challenges sa area ng Samar

asr-004092
03:18:42.200 --> 03:18:44.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: at sa area ng ibang areas po ng Bicol.

asr-004093
03:18:44.760 --> 03:18:47.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ngayon po, talagang dinetalye na po natin

asr-004094
03:18:47.540 --> 03:18:48.660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: yung engineering planning.

asr-004095
03:18:48.660 --> 03:18:51.600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nito, humingi pa po tayo ng tulong

asr-004096
03:18:51.600 --> 03:18:53.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: sa ating mga Japanese consultants

asr-004097
03:18:53.260 --> 03:18:55.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: para po po rin yung mga problem areas

asr-004098
03:18:55.800 --> 03:18:57.360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: sa Samar at sa Andaya Highway

asr-004099
03:18:57.360 --> 03:19:00.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na laging tinutubig at nasisira ang ilalim

asr-004100
03:19:00.520 --> 03:19:01.740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: e ma-address na.

asr-004101
03:19:02.660 --> 03:19:05.400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya tingin ko po ngayon na nag-implement na tayo

asr-004102
03:19:05.400 --> 03:19:09.600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: both sa Andaya at sa parts of Albay

asr-004103
03:19:09.600 --> 03:19:12.440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: and also sa Samar and Northern Samar

asr-004104
03:19:12.440 --> 03:19:15.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: e maayos na po yung disenyo nitong mga to.

asr-004105
03:19:15.780 --> 03:19:18.040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Meron na po tayong proper cross-drainages,

asr-004106
03:19:18.800 --> 03:19:20.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: gumagamit na po tayo ng bagong technology

asr-004107
03:19:20.620 --> 03:19:25.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: such as geotextile technology na re-recommenda po ng Japan.

asr-004108
03:19:26.400 --> 03:19:28.020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So masasolve na po yun.

asr-004109
03:19:28.020 --> 03:19:31.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ikalawa po, kailangan po tuloy-tuloy ang pagpupondo.

asr-004110
03:19:33.020 --> 03:19:37.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At nagpapasalamat po ako sa Stephen,

asr-004111
03:19:38.840 --> 03:19:41.640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: sa kaya kong Mike at sa mga congressman po natin

asr-004112
03:19:42.170 --> 03:19:46.960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: at mga congressman natin sa Bicol at sa iba pang area

asr-004113
03:19:46.960 --> 03:19:48.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na sirasira ang Maharlika Highway.

asr-004114
03:19:48.600 --> 03:19:51.000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dahil po talagang sinusuporta nila tayo dyan.

asr-004115
03:19:51.300 --> 03:19:54.660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And tingin ko po at ito po ay kinumit ng Pangulo

asr-004116
03:19:54.860 --> 03:19:56.900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na before the end of his term,

asr-004117
03:19:56.900 --> 03:20:00.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: at least yung mga perennial na sirasirang parte

asr-004118
03:20:00.800 --> 03:20:03.600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ng Maharlika Highway sa Region 4A,

asr-004119
03:20:03.720 --> 03:20:05.900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: sa southern parts of Quezon,

asr-004120
03:20:06.520 --> 03:20:10.200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: mula Lopez, sorry, mula Pagbilaw hanggang Tagkawayan,

asr-004121
03:20:10.940 --> 03:20:12.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: sa Andaya Highway po, sa CamSur,

asr-004122
03:20:13.600 --> 03:20:15.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: some parts of Albay,

asr-004123
03:20:17.060 --> 03:20:17.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: isiskip ko po.

asr-004124
03:20:17.940 --> 03:20:19.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ang sorsugon, dahil maayos po ang sorsugon.

asr-004125
03:20:20.800 --> 03:20:23.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Tapos pagpasok na po ng Northern Samar hanggang Tacloban,

asr-004126
03:20:24.640 --> 03:20:28.000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: e tingin ko po, e maayos na po natin.

asr-004127
03:20:28.020 --> 03:20:30.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At slowly but surely po, nakikita naman po natin

asr-004128
03:20:30.700 --> 03:20:33.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: sa tulong ng ating mga congressman,

asr-004129
03:20:34.340 --> 03:20:36.420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: yung mga iba pong area na dinaanan natin,

asr-004130
03:20:36.420 --> 03:20:39.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kung yung Pinabacdao, yung ibang area sa 1st District din,

asr-004131
03:20:40.680 --> 03:20:42.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: dahan-dahan pong naayos na po natin with your help.

asr-004132
03:20:43.220 --> 03:20:44.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Maraming salamat po.

asr-004133
03:20:44.180 --> 03:20:46.200
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, congressman James.

asr-004134
03:20:46.820 --> 03:20:47.780
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: And thank you.

asr-004135
03:20:47.800 --> 03:20:48.040
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Secretary.

asr-004136
03:20:48.580 --> 03:20:49.680
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Next, from the majority,

asr-004137
03:20:50.060 --> 03:20:52.480
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Congressman Howard Guintu.

asr-004138
03:20:55.000 --> 03:20:56.720
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-004139
03:20:56.860 --> 03:20:58.940
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Mr. Chair, I would like to ask,

asr-004140
03:20:58.940 --> 03:21:00.940
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: regarding the policy of DPWH

asr-004141
03:21:00.940 --> 03:21:04.160
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: in allocating funds for right-of-way acquisition and compensation,

asr-004142
03:21:06.680 --> 03:21:09.480
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: and regarding that, what is the process?

asr-004143
03:21:10.000 --> 03:21:14.680
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Is it centralized or separated for projects?

asr-004144
03:21:21.120 --> 03:21:22.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Very sorry po, Cong Howard.

asr-004145
03:21:23.340 --> 03:21:23.740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: I'm sorry.

asr-004146
03:21:23.760 --> 03:21:23.980
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: No problem.

asr-004147
03:21:25.380 --> 03:21:27.520
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Mr. Chair, I'd like to ask lang po,

asr-004148
03:21:27.520 --> 03:21:30.920
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: regarding po yung sa allocating ng funds for right-of-way acquisitions

asr-004149
03:21:30.920 --> 03:21:32.860
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: and yung compensation po,

asr-004150
03:21:32.960 --> 03:21:36.120
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: yun po ba ay hiwalay sa pagpo-procure natin ng project

asr-004151
03:21:36.120 --> 03:21:38.260
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: or yung paglalaan po ng pondo,

asr-004152
03:21:38.280 --> 03:21:40.460
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: papaano po ba yung proseso nun sa right-of-way?

asr-004153
03:21:42.620 --> 03:21:46.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hiwalay po sa project, Mr. Chairman,

asr-004154
03:21:46.740 --> 03:21:49.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ang region po ang nagpo-proseso.

asr-004155
03:21:49.960 --> 03:21:51.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ngayon po ay, ano po, no,

asr-004156
03:21:51.140 --> 03:21:54.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: pinaprioritize po natin ngayon

asr-004157
03:21:54.300 --> 03:21:57.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: yung mga payment-ready na tinatawag

asr-004158
03:21:57.880 --> 03:21:59.460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: o voucher-ready na tinatawag.

asr-004159
03:21:59.460 --> 03:21:59.820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: natin.

asr-004160
03:21:59.820 --> 03:22:01.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: either may court order na

asr-004161
03:22:01.500 --> 03:22:04.200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: or negotiated na

asr-004162
03:22:04.200 --> 03:22:08.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: at pumayag na po ang mga nagbenta ng lupa

asr-004163
03:22:08.520 --> 03:22:12.960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: at yung mga expropriation cases po

asr-004164
03:22:12.960 --> 03:22:17.820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na may order na po na mag-deposit ng 15%

asr-004165
03:22:17.820 --> 03:22:23.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: sa korte nung ating right-of-way payments.

asr-004166
03:22:23.920 --> 03:22:24.700
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Mr. Chair,

asr-004167
03:22:24.820 --> 03:22:28.640
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: based po dun sa ating nirequest,

asr-004168
03:22:28.940 --> 03:22:30.580
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: pwede po ba man natin malaman kung ilan,

asr-004169
03:22:30.580 --> 03:22:32.800
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: how much po yung inallocate natin

asr-004170
03:22:32.800 --> 03:22:34.420
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: for fiscal year 2027?

asr-004171
03:22:38.700 --> 03:22:42.560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: 15 billion po ang hiningi namin ngayong 2027.

asr-004172
03:22:44.300 --> 03:22:45.720
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: 15 billion po yung hiningi.

asr-004173
03:22:46.040 --> 03:22:48.080
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Sapat na po ba yun para sa...

asr-004174
03:22:48.080 --> 03:22:48.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi po.

asr-004176
03:22:49.820 --> 03:22:51.860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Halos 90 billion po ang utang.

asr-004177
03:22:53.200 --> 03:22:54.440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero in the past po,

asr-004178
03:22:54.540 --> 03:22:55.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: last year po,

asr-004179
03:22:55.860 --> 03:22:58.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: this year po, 5 billion lang po.

asr-004180
03:22:59.000 --> 03:23:00.100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: 5 billion.

asr-004181
03:23:00.260 --> 03:23:02.740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ngayon pong 2026 po ang mabibigay.

asr-004182
03:23:02.760 --> 03:23:05.460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Madalas po talagang napag-iiwanan po

asr-004183
03:23:05.460 --> 03:23:07.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ang right-of-way payments.

asr-004184
03:23:07.480 --> 03:23:09.820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya hihingi po talaga kami ng tulong.

asr-004185
03:23:10.360 --> 03:23:12.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Palaki po nang palaki ang utang natin

asr-004186
03:23:12.520 --> 03:23:13.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: sa ating mga kapabayan.

asr-004187
03:23:15.400 --> 03:23:16.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At dumadagdag po,

asr-004188
03:23:16.620 --> 03:23:18.040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: lalo na yung mga court-ordered

asr-004189
03:23:18.040 --> 03:23:19.560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: right-of-way payments,

asr-004190
03:23:19.900 --> 03:23:22.360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: yung interest payments po dito ay mabigat.

asr-004191
03:23:22.360 --> 03:23:23.860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Every year po,

asr-004192
03:23:23.880 --> 03:23:25.440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: nag-incor tayo ng interest dito.

asr-004193
03:23:25.620 --> 03:23:28.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So 5 billion out of 90 billion,

asr-004194
03:23:28.600 --> 03:23:31.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: malaking kakulangan po ang kailangan.

asr-004195
03:23:31.740 --> 03:23:33.260
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: The reason why I'm asking,

asr-004196
03:23:33.420 --> 03:23:35.700
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: kasi sa aking distrito,

asr-004197
03:23:35.800 --> 03:23:38.220
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: marami po kasi kaming mga kalsada,

asr-004198
03:23:38.280 --> 03:23:39.680
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: mga circumferential roads na sayang po,

asr-004199
03:23:39.860 --> 03:23:40.860
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: hindi po magamit.

asr-004200
03:23:40.860 --> 03:23:41.320
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Gawa ng...

asr-004201
03:23:41.320 --> 03:23:44.240
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Yun din po ang right-of-way yung issue.

asr-004202
03:23:44.820 --> 03:23:45.820
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Nabigyan po ng,

asr-004203
03:23:45.820 --> 03:23:47.380
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: kumbaga ng right-of-way,

asr-004204
03:23:47.380 --> 03:23:49.500
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: pero dahil hindi na po nabayaran,

asr-004205
03:23:49.680 --> 03:23:52.160
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: napigil na po yung construction.

asr-004206
03:23:52.800 --> 03:23:54.400
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: So, kumbaga dati po,

asr-004207
03:23:54.400 --> 03:23:55.300
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: binigyan ng access,

asr-004208
03:23:55.300 --> 03:23:57.000
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: pero nahinto na po ngayon,

asr-004209
03:23:57.000 --> 03:23:58.640
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: ayaw na po pumayag ng mga landowners.

asr-004211
03:24:00.340 --> 03:24:03.480
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Nandito po yung mga vice chairman natin ng appropriation.

asr-004212
03:24:03.880 --> 03:24:08.060
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Narinig naman po natin yung request ng ating sekretary.

asr-004213
03:24:08.120 --> 03:24:12.460
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Baka po mabigyan natin ng additional allocation

asr-004214
03:24:12.460 --> 03:24:18.580
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: ang DPWH regarding right-of-way acquisition.

asr-004215
03:24:18.580 --> 03:24:22.060
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: I'm speaking not just on my behalf.

asr-004216
03:24:22.240 --> 03:24:24.660
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: I'm sure districts nationwide

asr-004217
03:24:24.660 --> 03:24:27.260
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: are experiencing the same situation,

asr-004218
03:24:27.260 --> 03:24:31.060
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: na maraming project ang nadedelay

asr-004219
03:24:31.060 --> 03:24:33.260
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: dahil po sa right-of-way payments.

asr-004220
03:24:33.640 --> 03:24:34.840
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Yun lang po, Mr. Chair.

asr-004221
03:24:35.060 --> 03:24:35.740
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Thank you po.

asr-004222
03:24:35.800 --> 03:24:37.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: That will be a very welcome development po,

asr-004223
03:24:37.920 --> 03:24:38.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mr. Chair.

asr-004224
03:24:38.900 --> 03:24:39.580
Rep. Ivan Howard A. Guintu: Thank you.

asr-004225
03:24:39.600 --> 03:24:40.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-004226
03:24:40.360 --> 03:24:40.840
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you. Thank you.

asr-004227
03:24:40.860 --> 03:24:41.540
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kong Howard.

asr-004228
03:24:42.300 --> 03:24:44.180
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Next, from the minority,

asr-004229
03:24:44.520 --> 03:24:46.320
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Congressman Michael Tan.

asr-004230
03:24:48.580 --> 03:24:49.920
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-004231
03:24:50.340 --> 03:24:52.140
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: And good afternoon po

asr-004232
03:24:52.140 --> 03:24:55.640
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: to the secretary and the rest of the DPWH family.

asr-004233
03:24:56.420 --> 03:24:57.360
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: So, una po, Sec,

asr-004234
03:24:58.040 --> 03:24:59.640
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: gusto ko pong magpasalamat

asr-004235
03:24:59.640 --> 03:25:02.080
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: kasi finally, after four years,

asr-004236
03:25:02.280 --> 03:25:04.600
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: nabigyan po ng pondo.

asr-004237
03:25:04.600 --> 03:25:07.220
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: As mentioned kanina ni Kong Stephen,

asr-004238
03:25:07.680 --> 03:25:09.600
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: every year po,

asr-004239
03:25:09.740 --> 03:25:12.880
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: yun at yun lang yung sinasabi namin dito.

asr-004240
03:25:13.600 --> 03:25:16.200
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: And finally, nadinig na po yun.

asr-004241
03:25:17.160 --> 03:25:18.940
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Just to give you po an update,

asr-004242
03:25:19.200 --> 03:25:22.840
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: yung tungkol naman po sa road right-of-way issues

asr-004243
03:25:22.840 --> 03:25:25.080
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: along Maharlika Highway

asr-004244
03:25:25.080 --> 03:25:27.880
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: ay inaasikaso na po ngayon ng provincial government.

asr-004245
03:25:28.440 --> 03:25:31.520
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Some of them are being paid through the provincial government.

asr-004246
03:25:31.700 --> 03:25:32.560
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: But of course,

asr-004247
03:25:32.640 --> 03:25:35.760
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: gusto din po naming humingi sa inyo

asr-004248
03:25:35.760 --> 03:25:38.700
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: if you can allocate funds para doon.

asr-004249
03:25:38.700 --> 03:25:41.800
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: But we are also doing kahit pa konti-konti

asr-004250
03:25:42.660 --> 03:25:43.900
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: through the provincial government.

asr-004251
03:25:46.340 --> 03:25:47.140
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Secondly po,

asr-004252
03:25:47.280 --> 03:25:51.160
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: itatanong ko nalang din po tungkol naman sa

asr-004253
03:25:51.160 --> 03:25:54.220
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: maintenance ng Maharlika Highway

asr-004254
03:25:54.220 --> 03:25:56.460
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: post-construction.

asr-004255
03:25:56.580 --> 03:25:58.460
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Kasi ano po ba yung mangyayari

asr-004256
03:25:58.460 --> 03:26:01.460
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: if nandyan na po yung Maharlika Highway

asr-004257
03:26:01.460 --> 03:26:02.860
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: at nagawa na po siya?

asr-004258
03:26:03.720 --> 03:26:06.740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Unang-una po, maraming salamat, Kong Mike.

asr-004259
03:26:07.200 --> 03:26:09.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Alam ko po yung talagang passion ninyo,

asr-004260
03:26:09.760 --> 03:26:11.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: talagang na maayos ng Maharlika Highway.

asr-004261
03:26:11.500 --> 03:26:13.740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At salamat po sa tulong ninyo sa right-of-way.

asr-004262
03:26:14.360 --> 03:26:15.020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Malaking bagay po yan.

asr-004263
03:26:15.020 --> 03:26:16.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero ngayon po talagang ano, ah

asr-004264
03:26:16.560 --> 03:26:20.200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ang next phase na po natin sa Maharlika Highway,

asr-004265
03:26:20.360 --> 03:26:21.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: pagkatapos po nating maayos,

asr-004266
03:26:21.840 --> 03:26:23.740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kailangan na po tayong mag-widening.

asr-004268
03:26:24.700 --> 03:26:27.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At kailangan po natin yung right-of-way para dyan.

asr-004269
03:26:28.080 --> 03:26:29.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: On the maintenance po,

asr-004270
03:26:29.620 --> 03:26:32.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: maganda din pong tanong yan at napaka-importante.

asr-004271
03:26:32.620 --> 03:26:35.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Madalas din pong naka-cut ang routine maintenance budget

asr-004272
03:26:35.480 --> 03:26:37.020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ng DPWH.

asr-004273
03:26:37.020 --> 03:26:40.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At dyan po kinukuha ang maintenance funds

asr-004274
03:26:40.780 --> 03:26:43.560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: para sa mga national roads natin.

asr-004275
03:26:43.600 --> 03:26:46.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Especially N1, especially Maharlika Highway.

asr-004276
03:26:46.920 --> 03:26:49.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya po, hihingi din po kami ng tulong na sana po,

asr-004277
03:26:49.560 --> 03:26:53.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: e wag din pong sanang mabawasan ang ating maintenance funds.

asr-004278
03:26:53.260 --> 03:26:54.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dahil critical din po yan

asr-004279
03:26:54.480 --> 03:26:57.840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: sa pag-maintain natin ang ating national highways.

asr-004280
03:26:57.840 --> 03:27:00.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero tuloy-tuloy po tayo,

asr-004281
03:27:00.120 --> 03:27:03.100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mr. Chairman, Congressman,

asr-004282
03:27:03.460 --> 03:27:06.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: sisiguraduhin natin ang ma-maintain natin na maayos

asr-004283
03:27:06.380 --> 03:27:08.420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: at masalimuot tayo sa pag-maintain.

asr-004284
03:27:08.420 --> 03:27:09.320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: In fact, ngayon nga po,

asr-004285
03:27:10.500 --> 03:27:10.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: talagang ano po,

asr-004286
03:27:10.840 --> 03:27:14.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: yung dati pong tinatawag nilang patsi-patsi lang,

asr-004287
03:27:14.440 --> 03:27:18.860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: e talagang ginagamit na po natin yung mga methodologies

asr-004288
03:27:18.860 --> 03:27:20.980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na nakikita natin for routine maintenance

asr-004289
03:27:20.980 --> 03:27:22.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: sa ibang bansa.

asr-004290
03:27:22.380 --> 03:27:24.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Para masigurado po na kahit papano naman,

asr-004291
03:27:24.320 --> 03:27:29.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: itatagal po ang mga maintenance works na ginagawa natin

asr-004292
03:27:29.140 --> 03:27:30.900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: lalo na sa mga national highways natin.

asr-004293
03:27:32.080 --> 03:27:33.000
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Thank you.

asr-004294
03:27:33.100 --> 03:27:34.120
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: And sana po,

asr-004295
03:27:34.280 --> 03:27:37.860
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: yung post-construction matutukan talaga yung maintenance

asr-004296
03:27:37.860 --> 03:27:44.020
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: because during the time po na umabot sa part na nasira na talaga,

asr-004297
03:27:44.020 --> 03:27:46.780
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: na patsi-patsi na talaga yung Maharlika Highway,

asr-004298
03:27:47.100 --> 03:27:49.480
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: it started in small segments lang.

asr-004299
03:27:49.480 --> 03:27:51.460
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: That if nagawan lang sana,

asr-004300
03:27:51.460 --> 03:27:52.340
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: ng paraan,

asr-004301
03:27:52.340 --> 03:27:53.400
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: through maintenance

asr-004302
03:27:53.400 --> 03:27:56.320
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: or baka yung section na yun inayos,

asr-004303
03:27:56.360 --> 03:27:57.660
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: hindi siya parang naging parang nagsangasanga

asr-004304
03:27:59.740 --> 03:28:01.780
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: hanggang lumaki nang lumaki nang lumaki.

asr-004305
03:28:02.040 --> 03:28:06.120
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: So, I hope that the good secretary and the DPWH

asr-004306
03:28:06.120 --> 03:28:09.500
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: can do something about it post-construction po.

asr-004307
03:28:10.380 --> 03:28:12.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Well, we will do that, Mr. Chairman.

asr-004308
03:28:12.680 --> 03:28:16.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sana po hindi na maulit yung nasisira ulit

asr-004309
03:28:16.880 --> 03:28:19.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: at ma-maintain po natin ang mabuti

asr-004310
03:28:19.180 --> 03:28:21.200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ang napaka-importante nating Maharlika Highway

asr-004312
03:28:21.620 --> 03:28:23.640
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Okay. Thank you, Mr. Secretary.

asr-004313
03:28:23.640 --> 03:28:25.080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: With your support po, sir. Thank you po.

asr-004314
03:28:25.900 --> 03:28:27.600
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: My next topic po is,

asr-004315
03:28:27.800 --> 03:28:30.940
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: dati po nagre-reklamo ako tungkol sa Maharlika Highway

asr-004316
03:28:30.940 --> 03:28:33.400
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: kasi po hindi siya napupondohan

asr-004317
03:28:33.400 --> 03:28:38.000
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: or hindi sapat yung pondo na inabibigay sa Maharlika Highway.

asr-004318
03:28:38.320 --> 03:28:42.140
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Pero sec, masyado ata ang ginalingan niyo yung sa Maharlika Highway

asr-004319
03:28:42.140 --> 03:28:44.140
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: na yung nangyari naman ngayon,

asr-004320
03:28:44.140 --> 03:28:47.840
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: wala na pong local projects na pondo para sa distrito ko po.

asr-004321
03:28:47.840 --> 03:28:52.300
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: So ngayon po, the problem naman ng distrito ko is

asr-004322
03:28:52.300 --> 03:28:56.140
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: lahat po ng pondo ay nasa Maharlika Highway na

asr-004323
03:28:56.140 --> 03:29:02.400
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: wala na po tayong local roads, wala na po tayong hospital projects,

asr-004324
03:29:02.940 --> 03:29:08.660
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: wala na po tayong MPV, wala na po tayong drainage canal,

asr-004325
03:29:08.940 --> 03:29:13.860
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: wala na po mga flood mitigation programs para dun po sa distrito ko po.

asr-004326
03:29:13.860 --> 03:29:17.500
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: And in the past, in the previous years,

asr-004327
03:29:17.920 --> 03:29:20.300
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: alam naman po natin na hindi lang naman po,

asr-004328
03:29:20.300 --> 03:29:22.880
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: highway lang din po yung problema ng Samar.

asr-004329
03:29:23.260 --> 03:29:25.000
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Malaki po yung area ng Samar.

asr-004330
03:29:25.120 --> 03:29:28.560
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: We have 524 barangays in my district alone.

asr-004331
03:29:29.370 --> 03:29:37.260
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: We have 15 municipalities and 1 city with 500,000 na population.

asr-004332
03:29:37.260 --> 03:29:41.800
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: May dalawa po kaming municipality na islands.

asr-004333
03:29:42.240 --> 03:29:44.120
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Meron din kaming mga GIDA areas.

asr-004334
03:29:44.480 --> 03:29:48.200
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: And since wala pong pondo ngayon for the local projects,

asr-004343
03:29:48.600 --> 03:29:51.220
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: yun naman po yung magiging problema namin.

asr-004344
03:29:51.420 --> 03:29:56.200
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: So, I would ask or seek the clarification from the Secretary

asr-004345
03:29:56.200 --> 03:30:03.060
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: kung bakit po nagkaganon and how can we rectify this problem po.

asr-004346
03:30:05.160 --> 03:30:06.080
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Tama po yun.

asr-004347
03:30:07.840 --> 03:30:10.220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Limitado din po talaga ang fiscal space natin.

asr-004348
03:30:10.340 --> 03:30:15.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At ang primary mandate po ng DPWH talaga

asr-004349
03:30:15.380 --> 03:30:19.000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ay talagang ayusin natin ang ating mga national roads.

asr-004350
03:30:19.000 --> 03:30:21.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero naiintindihan ko po as we discussed yesterday

asr-004351
03:30:21.720 --> 03:30:26.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kung kailangan din naman ang local roads.

asr-004352
03:30:26.540 --> 03:30:29.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And kinausap ko na po ang ating regional director

asr-004353
03:30:29.720 --> 03:30:33.960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: at ang mga district engineers na mag-ano din po.

asr-004354
03:30:34.060 --> 03:30:38.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kung pwede pong mag-ano tayo, magkaroon tayo ng mga

asr-004355
03:30:38.200 --> 03:30:40.000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: especially yung mga continuing,

asr-004356
03:30:40.300 --> 03:30:43.860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: yung mga ongoing po na projects natin sa inyong distrito.

asr-004357
03:30:43.860 --> 03:30:47.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At yung napaka-importante po nating tri-boundary roads

asr-004358
03:30:47.260 --> 03:30:52.000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na pinag-usapan po natin nung ako po'y nandun sa Region 8,

asr-004359
03:30:52.160 --> 03:30:54.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: eh mapondohan din po.

asr-004360
03:30:54.520 --> 03:30:59.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: But ang primary mandate po talaga ng DPWH yung national roads

asr-004361
03:30:59.800 --> 03:31:02.820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: pero ano naman po, pwede naman po tayo.

asr-004362
03:31:02.820 --> 03:31:05.200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kailangan nga po talaga masigurado natin

asr-004363
03:31:05.200 --> 03:31:07.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na magpa-prioritize tayo ng ating continuing.

asr-004364
03:31:07.540 --> 03:31:09.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At the same time, syempre po,

asr-004365
03:31:09.660 --> 03:31:13.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kumpleto po lahat ng ating mga requirements sa lahat ng mga proyekto.

asr-004366
03:31:13.860 --> 03:31:15.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, okay po yun.

asr-004367
03:31:16.280 --> 03:31:18.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Importante din naman po yung mga local roads,

asr-004368
03:31:18.760 --> 03:31:22.220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: especially for GIDA areas na kailangan-kailangan ng infrastructure.

asr-004369
03:31:22.960 --> 03:31:25.080
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Thank you, Mr. Secretary.

asr-004370
03:31:26.220 --> 03:31:30.100
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Umaasa po ako na sana ma-address po itong concern ko

asr-004371
03:31:30.100 --> 03:31:33.800
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: kasi it will be a big problem also for us,

asr-004372
03:31:33.800 --> 03:31:36.660
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: especially in Samar, na as mentioned kanina,

asr-004373
03:31:36.660 --> 03:31:38.360
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: malaki po yung area namin.

asr-004374
03:31:38.360 --> 03:31:42.340
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: And because of that, kung wala po tayong mga local roads,

asr-004375
03:31:43.740 --> 03:31:48.500
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: itong mga far-flung baranggays would have a very difficult time,

asr-004376
03:31:48.640 --> 03:31:52.340
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: especially itong mga island municipalities also.

asr-004377
03:31:52.520 --> 03:32:04.340
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Also po, gusto ko lang din po, again, to thank the DPWH family

asr-004378
03:32:04.340 --> 03:32:09.820
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: and hopefully ito pong mga concern namin sa

asr-004379
03:32:09.820 --> 03:32:10.940
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Local.

asr-004380
03:32:12.360 --> 03:32:17.060
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Pinakikinggan nyo po ito kasi during the time that we were seeking your assistance

asr-004381
03:32:17.060 --> 03:32:21.140
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: for the Maharlika Highway, nakailang punta po kayo sa Samar.

asr-004382
03:32:21.520 --> 03:32:24.780
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Siguro nga po parang nagsasawa na rin kayo sa amin

asr-004383
03:32:24.780 --> 03:32:28.940
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: kasi lagi nyo na po kaming nakikita.

asr-004384
03:32:29.460 --> 03:32:33.700
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Pero hindi lang po talaga Maharlika Highway yung problem namin.

asr-004385
03:32:33.700 --> 03:32:39.860
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: So, I hope that yung na-raise ko pong concern about the local projects

asr-004386
03:32:39.860 --> 03:32:41.220
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: is ma-address po natin.

asr-004387
03:32:42.160 --> 03:32:44.400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, makakaasa po kayo, Mr. Chairman, Kong Mike.

asr-004388
03:32:45.100 --> 03:32:49.680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And makakaasa po din po ako na hindi ako magsasawa at babalikan po natin ang Samar

asr-004389
03:32:49.680 --> 03:32:56.020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: dahil kailangan po talaga ng mga kababayan natin doon yung infrastructure na maayos.

asr-004390
03:32:56.480 --> 03:32:57.360
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Thank you po.

asr-004391
03:32:57.500 --> 03:33:00.320
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: And lastly, thank you din po sa Calviga Bridge.

asr-004392
03:33:00.320 --> 03:33:02.300
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: At least ngayon, nadadaanan na po.

asr-004393
03:33:02.460 --> 03:33:02.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo.

asr-004394
03:33:03.100 --> 03:33:04.320
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Malaking tulong po yun.

asr-004395
03:33:04.320 --> 03:33:06.940
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: And also the San Juanico Bridge po.

asr-004396
03:33:07.100 --> 03:33:07.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ay, Liloan pala nasa baba.

asr-004397
03:33:08.080 --> 03:33:10.200
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: O, San Juanico Bridge po.

asr-004399
03:33:11.740 --> 03:33:12.620
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Nadadaanan na po rin.

asr-004400
03:33:12.680 --> 03:33:13.320
Rep. Reynolds Michael T. Tan: Thank you po.

asr-004401
03:33:14.240 --> 03:33:14.920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Maraming salamat.

asr-004403
03:33:15.080 --> 03:33:18.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At ayusin pa rin po natin tuloy-tuloy ang Calbiga Bridge para po.

asr-004404
03:33:18.440 --> 03:33:23.220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Awa ng Diyos, hindi naman po tayo magka-aberya

asr-004405
03:33:23.220 --> 03:33:23.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Salamat po.

asr-004406
03:33:23.900 --> 03:33:24.300
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, Secretary.

asr-004407
03:33:24.440 --> 03:33:29.460
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Next, from the majority, Congressman Salvador Pleyto.

asr-004408
03:33:31.340 --> 03:33:32.920
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-004409
03:33:34.560 --> 03:33:38.000
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Magandang hapon po sa DPWH family.

asr-004410
03:33:38.000 --> 03:33:45.980
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Family, headed by walang kapaguran na Secretary Vince, na hindi yata natutulog na po ito.

asr-004423
03:33:46.460 --> 03:33:50.700
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Nakikita naman namin, Secretary, mula sa mga bundok ng Cotelera,

asr-004424
03:33:53.120 --> 03:33:57.480
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: at Alcima Highway, papunta ka dito sa Marcos Highway, dito sa Cailin Road,

asr-004425
03:33:57.740 --> 03:34:03.520
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: papunta sa mga bumagsak na Maharlika, dito sa mga bumagsak na tuloy ninyo sa Visayas,

asr-004426
03:34:04.420 --> 03:34:07.600
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: hanggang sa mga road trips na Mindanao, kung saan saan pa.

asr-004427
03:34:08.220 --> 03:34:11.240
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Ang una kong tanong, Secretary, nakakatulog po ba kayo?

asr-004428
03:34:12.640 --> 03:34:13.460
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: para tumahan.

asr-004429
03:34:13.700 --> 03:34:14.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Oo naman po.

asr-004430
03:34:15.660 --> 03:34:17.100
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: Kasi nung pumasok po kayo dito,

asr-004431
03:34:17.180 --> 03:34:17.840
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: slim na kayo,

asr-004432
03:34:17.840 --> 03:34:19.000
Rep. Salvador A. Pleyto: mas slim pa kayo ngayon.

asr-004433
03:34:20.460 --> 03:34:21.200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Trabaho lang po.

asr-004434
03:34:21.820 --> 03:34:22.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Maraming salamat po.

asr-004435
03:34:22.760 --> 03:34:23.240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Tuloy-tuloy.

asr-004436
03:34:24.520 --> 03:34:25.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Habang buhay po.

asr-004437
03:34:25.440 --> 03:34:26.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Habang buhay po.

asr-004438
03:34:26.220 --> 03:34:27.160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kanina umaga pa po ako dito.

asr-004439
03:34:27.160 --> 03:34:27.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mr. Chairman

asr-004440
03:34:28.760 --> 03:34:29.320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pag patay na eh.

asr-004441
03:34:29.320 --> 03:34:29.900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Wala na.

asr-004442
03:34:29.920 --> 03:34:30.860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Balik-balik lang po kami

asr-004443
03:34:30.860 --> 03:34:31.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kasi sabay-sabay

asr-004444
03:34:31.880 --> 03:34:32.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: tatlo briefing

asr-004445
03:34:32.760 --> 03:34:34.220
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: saka kay speaker.

asr-004446
03:34:34.420 --> 03:34:35.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Diyan lang kami galing ngayon.

asr-004447
03:34:35.460 --> 03:34:37.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: May mga concern sila

