asr-005205
04:00:24.720 --> 04:00:28.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Unang-una po nung natanggap ko nga po yung sulat, Mr. Chairman, Kong Arnie,

asr-005206
04:00:29.300 --> 04:00:36.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: at dumulog po ako sa DENR, kay Sekretary Cuna, para po mapag-usapan na kung ano ba ang rules.

asr-005207
04:00:36.660 --> 04:00:40.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi yung enforcement po nito, tagay kang nasa party na po ng DENR.

asr-005208
04:00:42.800 --> 04:00:50.920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero, ang ayaw na ayaw po natin, magka-abirya at maapektuhan ang mga national projects.

asr-005209
04:00:51.020 --> 04:00:55.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Hindi lang po ng DPWH, kundi pati po ng mga ibang ahensya.

asr-005210
04:00:55.240 --> 04:01:02.640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Tugay na, mabawa, sa DOTR, yung po sa airport sa Naga, mayroon din po mga reports.

asr-005211
04:01:02.860 --> 04:01:04.660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Although, mukhang okay na po yun.

asr-005212
04:01:05.360 --> 04:01:05.920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sana po.

asr-005213
04:01:06.160 --> 04:01:09.240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yung po, mukhang tuloy-tuloy na po at wala na pong aberya ngayon.

asr-005214
04:01:09.240 --> 04:01:10.420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero po,

asr-005215
04:01:10.440 --> 04:01:18.840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kailangan po talagang mag-usap-usap ang mga ahensya, lalo na ang DENR, para po klaro ang policy on these issues.

asr-005216
04:01:18.840 --> 04:01:25.960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, makakaasa po kayo na tuloy-tuloy po akong makikipagdulog sa DENR para po makahanap na po tayo.

asr-005217
04:01:25.960 --> 04:01:33.220
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, salamat po. Pero, any local ordinance, I became a mayor also,

asr-005218
04:01:33.860 --> 04:01:38.540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: pag magawa po tayo ng batas locally, we cannot supersede any national law.

asr-005219
04:01:38.540 --> 04:01:39.360
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Tama po.

asr-005220
04:01:39.360 --> 04:01:40.820
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, even confiscation.

asr-005221
04:01:40.840 --> 04:01:43.040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: impounding, nangyayari po sa amin yan.

asr-005222
04:01:43.040 --> 04:01:46.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Ang kumukuha po is Sagip Kalikasan Task Force.

asr-005223
04:01:46.100 --> 04:01:50.400
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And para makuha nyo is mag-file po kayo ng kaso po sa korte.

asr-005224
04:01:50.400 --> 04:01:55.560
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And alam naman po natin yung justice system natin, pag-file pa lang, pagbayad, etc.

asr-005225
04:01:55.560 --> 04:02:02.240
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But, with regards to this matter, medyo malala na po yung nangyayari sa amin.

asr-005226
04:02:02.240 --> 04:02:09.540
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: In fact, may isa pong, I won't mention the name, but may isa pong contractor, anim na bako na po, ang kinuha.

asr-005227
04:02:10.760 --> 04:02:16.720
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Dahil po gumagawa sa aming boulevard, and that is the Partido Boulevard along the coastline.

asr-005228
04:02:17.980 --> 04:02:27.700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, siyempre po may bako ka para gumawa ng pundasyon, kailangan pong gamitin yun, kinukonfiscate po yun.

asr-005229
04:02:27.700 --> 04:02:32.280
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, I don't know, this is beyond politics, sir.

asr-005230
04:02:32.280 --> 04:02:39.100
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, I don't want you to be involved in local politics, but this is a national project already.

asr-005231
04:02:39.100 --> 04:02:50.040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: There are abuses of Sangib Kalikasan Task Force, na ang alam ko po talaga, even DNR, not only DNR, but the PNP, it's a composite team.

asr-005232
04:02:50.040 --> 04:02:56.860
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Dapat po deputize ka, kasama po yung DNR, pag-implement, and even po ang ating kapolisan.

asr-005233
04:02:56.860 --> 04:03:02.200
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But, thank you, at least you are very well aware of the situation.

asr-005234
04:03:02.540 --> 04:03:05.960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Lalo na po, minsan mga line canal, re-blocking.

asr-005235
04:03:08.360 --> 04:03:17.580
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Minsan po, pag sa amin nag-landslide, may landslide, pag nag-clearing ka ng daan, tinatawag na po yun, quarrying.

asr-005236
04:03:18.540 --> 04:03:20.400
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, that is the situation.

asr-005237
04:03:20.400 --> 04:03:25.940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: I don't know kung sa amin lang pong distrito yan, or sa buong pong Pilipinas.

asr-005238
04:03:25.940 --> 04:03:32.040
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, I hope we can stop the abuse na ginagawa po, na nangyayari po sa amin.

asr-005239
04:03:32.040 --> 04:03:34.340
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So, dumudulog lang po kami sa inyo, sir.

asr-005240
04:03:34.340 --> 04:03:37.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo, makakaasa po kayo, Mr. Chairman.

asr-005241
04:03:37.260 --> 04:03:39.560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi, ayaw na ayaw po natin.

asr-005242
04:03:39.580 --> 04:03:43.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: yung nade-delay ang mga proyekto kasi kailangan-kailangan po ito ng mga kababayan natin.

asr-005243
04:03:43.740 --> 04:03:48.940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you, Chair. That's it. I'm fully supportive of your leadership.

asr-005244
04:03:48.940 --> 04:03:49.700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you very much.

asr-005245
04:03:49.880 --> 04:03:50.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Thank you Cong Arnie, thank you,

asr-005246
04:03:50.520 --> 04:03:52.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mr. Chairman.

asr-005247
04:03:52.920 --> 04:03:56.020
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, thank you, Kong Arnie.

asr-005248
04:03:56.020 --> 04:04:04.380
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Next, to ask more questions, Congressman Toto Mangudadatu.

asr-005249
04:04:10.000 --> 04:04:13.000
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Bismillahirrahmanirrahim. Assalamualaikum warahmatullahi wabarakatuh.

asr-005250
04:04:13.620 --> 04:04:14.360
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Magandang hapon.

asr-005251
04:04:14.360 --> 04:04:23.360
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Sa lahat, una-una, ako'y magpapasalamat kay Secretary Vince at sa kanyang mga kawane sa mga undersecretaries natin

asr-005252
04:04:23.360 --> 04:04:33.200
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: at kay Undersecretary Charles Calima na walang humpay at walang kapaguran na bisitahin yung lugar namin doon sa Maguindanao Del Sur

asr-005253
04:04:33.900 --> 04:04:39.600
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: dahil sa programa ng mahal natin na Pangulo, itong plan kontrabaha.

asr-005254
04:04:39.600 --> 04:04:44.460
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Ako'y nasisiyahan at nagagalak doon sa mga...

asr-005255
04:04:44.460 --> 04:04:59.420
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: ginawa niyong pag-seal doon sa mga materials na nasa stretch na mula sa aking munisipyo,

asr-005256
04:04:59.500 --> 04:05:08.500
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Buluan, Maguindanao, traversing the municipality of Pandag, Paglat, all the way to General SK Pentaton.

asr-005257
04:05:10.240 --> 04:05:12.520
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Yung sa natapos po nila, if I...

asr-005258
04:05:12.600 --> 04:05:15.100
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: if I'm not mistaken, ano,

asr-005260
04:05:15.280 --> 04:05:22.800
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: may kahabaan na po, more or less mga 15 kilometers.

asr-005261
04:05:23.940 --> 04:05:27.300
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Kung saan titignan po natin, hindi naman ganun kalakihan

asr-005262
04:05:27.300 --> 04:05:33.480
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: ang naialat doon sa stretch na yun

asr-005263
04:05:33.480 --> 04:05:37.380
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: dahil sa mga pinahiram sa amin

asr-005264
04:05:37.380 --> 04:05:39.700
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: ng mga amphibious backhoes, ano,

asr-005265
04:05:40.000 --> 04:05:43.620
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: may galing pa po sa Clark,

asr-005266
04:05:43.620 --> 04:05:46.660
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: na yung with chopper, Secretary.

asr-005267
04:05:47.400 --> 04:05:49.300
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Ayon ang malaking pasalamat namin sa inyo.

asr-005268
04:05:49.380 --> 04:05:54.040
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Ang effort po ninyo, effort po ni Usec. Calima at mga kawani

asr-005269
04:05:54.040 --> 04:05:56.040
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: ng taga

asr-005270
04:05:56.040 --> 04:05:57.880
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: DPWH-12

asr-005271
04:05:57.880 --> 04:06:01.100
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: kay former, dating director

asr-005272
04:06:01.100 --> 04:06:04.800
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: ng 12 kay Director Bashir Ebrahim,

asr-005273
04:06:04.800 --> 04:06:06.800
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: at sa ngayon kay Director Caya na

asr-005275
04:06:06.800 --> 04:06:11.620
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Sana ma'am tuloy-tuloy yung tuloy nyo sa amin.

asr-005276
04:06:14.340 --> 04:06:14.900
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: At

asr-005277
04:06:14.900 --> 04:06:37.720
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Sana po kasama po itong Mindanao River Basin na ito dahil alam po namin na mahirap po ang kalagayan namin doon at kung saan karamihan po sa mga former combatants ng MILF ay nariyan po sa area na yan.

asr-005278
04:06:37.720 --> 04:06:59.140
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: And sa 24 municipalities na yan, more than 10 ay nabilong sa low-lying area. At nung magkaroon ng dredging dito sa lugar na ito, karamihan po doon sa mga former combatants ay nagpapasalamat dahil po doon sa offline kontrabahan na iyon.

asr-005279
04:06:59.140 --> 04:07:05.680
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: At kanila mga sakaan ay napaayos at nakakapag-harvest na sila na mabuti.

asr-005280
04:07:05.920 --> 04:07:24.560
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Meron lang akong isang complaint dito, Mr. Secretary. Ito ang isang bridge summit doon sa Bulon, Maguindanao na kailang beses po kami panawagan sa kanila ay hindi nila tinugunan yung panawagan namin.

asr-005281
04:07:24.560 --> 04:07:34.040
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: In fact, we even made a resolution na panawagan doon sa Jargon Construction, ano?

asr-005282
04:07:34.040 --> 04:07:52.500
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Na nagdumot ng malaking baha at nagdulot ng maraming nadiskrasya doon sa lugar na iyon. Hanggang ngayon, hindi nila in-address yung mga may mga nadiskrasya doon ng mga tao sa Bulon, Maguindanao yan, Secretary.

asr-005283
04:07:52.980 --> 04:08:06.060
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Sana po tulungan nyo kami na mapatawag man lang itong si jargon construction na ito at i-address nila yung panawagan ng mga nadiskrasya doon, anuhin nila yung mga hospital bills.

asr-005284
04:08:06.800 --> 04:08:22.360
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Ito ang kamakailan lang, nagdulot din ng sobrang baha doon sa amin, nagtakakami kasi walang ulan. Bakit nagkaroon ng spillover doon sa municipalities ng Mangudadato, ng Buluan, ng Pandag, ng Paglat, ng Esquipendaton.

asr-005285
04:08:22.360 --> 04:08:33.860
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: So, yung mga sakaan ng mga former combatants na iyon, na sana masaya na sila dahil na-scour na nga yung mga silted materials dahil doon sa kontrabaha, eh ngayon, nasayang yung mga sakaan na iyon.

asr-005286
04:08:33.880 --> 04:08:36.100
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Nasayang yung mga crops nila na yun, Secretary.

asr-005287
04:08:36.480 --> 04:08:49.040
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: So, sana po mapatawag yung pansinong may-ari ng construction na ito at mabigyan lang naman ng mga measures kung ano yung dapat mangyari sa kanila. Thank you so much.

asr-005288
04:08:49.580 --> 04:08:58.420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Una-una po, Mr. Chairman, inutusan ko na po ang ating Regional Director na i-show cause yung contratista.

asr-005289
04:08:58.640 --> 04:09:03.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At talagang kailangan panagutan muna yung mga, lalo na yung mga naaksidente po.

asr-005290
04:09:03.840 --> 04:09:06.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At ikalawa po, Mr. Chairman,

asr-005291
04:09:06.660 --> 04:09:12.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: in-inform lang din po ako na yung remaining 80 million na kailangan para to complete,

asr-005292
04:09:12.500 --> 04:09:15.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ito na po, binibid na po ngayon at ma-award na.

asr-005293
04:09:16.080 --> 04:09:22.440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And ang assurances po is by middle of next year, tapos na po tayo sa Buruan Bridge by middle of next year.

asr-005294
04:09:22.640 --> 04:09:24.140
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Thank you so much, Mr. Secretary.

asr-005295
04:09:24.400 --> 04:09:30.840
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Sana po, alam naman din natin na hindi naman ito pang matagalang paano doon sa lugar na yan.

asr-005296
04:09:31.060 --> 04:09:35.080
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: At sana po, masalit doon sa flood mitigation yung lugar na yan.

asr-005297
04:09:35.680 --> 04:09:41.960
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Dahil tulad ng sinabi ko sa inyo, yung mga nandyan sa area na yan ay mga former combatants.

asr-005298
04:09:41.980 --> 04:09:47.260
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Masaya po sila dahil nakita po nila yung proyekto ng ating mahal na Pangulo, proyekto po ng DPWH.

asr-005299
04:09:47.620 --> 04:09:52.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ako po mismo ay bibisita sa inyo, Mr. Chairman, Kong Toto, at ano,

asr-005300
04:09:52.340 --> 04:09:57.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Para po masigurado na mapukpuk natin ang kontratista na mag-deliver on time.

asr-005301
04:09:57.900 --> 04:10:00.380
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Marami salamat, Mr. Chairman. Marami salamat, Mr. Secretary.

asr-005302
04:10:04.240 --> 04:10:06.060
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, thank you, Kong Toto.

asr-005303
04:10:06.240 --> 04:10:11.860
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Next, to interpellate is Congresswoman Bernadette Escudero.

asr-005304
04:10:13.540 --> 04:10:19.940
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: Thank you, Mr. Chair. Good afternoon, Sec. Vince, and to the whole DPWH family.

asr-005305
04:10:20.760 --> 04:10:25.460
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: Good afternoon pa. Hindi pa tayo maabot sa good evening. Sana hindi na umabot.

asr-005306
04:10:26.520 --> 04:10:31.260
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: First of all, gusto kong pasalamatan si Sec. Vince for mentioning Sorsogon kanina.

asr-005307
04:10:31.260 --> 04:10:34.080
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: na isa sa pinakamagandang segment

asr-005308
04:10:34.080 --> 04:10:35.440
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: ng Maharlika Highway.

asr-005309
04:10:37.340 --> 04:10:39.780
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: Ayoko pong iangat yung bangko pero totoo po yan.

asr-005310
04:10:39.780 --> 04:10:46.880
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: And dito natin makikita talaga na pag pinagplanuhan talaga at tinutukan ng isang proyekto, kaya talagang tapusin na maganda.

asr-005311
04:10:46.880 --> 04:10:54.700
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: And I think under your leadership, Sec, at nakita ko na tututukan nyo talaga yung Maharlika Highway,

asr-005312
04:10:54.700 --> 04:11:01.360
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: I am sure hindi lang po Sorsogon ang worth mentioning or ang mamimension nyo.

asr-005313
04:11:01.760 --> 04:11:03.180
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: At makakomment nyo.

asr-005314
04:11:03.180 --> 04:11:07.620
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: Within the next few months or years in this committee.

asr-005315
04:11:07.840 --> 04:11:09.460
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: So thank you very much, Sec.

asr-005316
04:11:10.320 --> 04:11:13.600
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: Also, gusto kong ibalik yung commendation.

asr-005317
04:11:13.700 --> 04:11:19.140
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: Gusto ko rin magpasalamat sa inyo dahil kanina nanonood ako kay minority leader.

asr-005318
04:11:19.140 --> 04:11:22.180
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: Siya yung unang-una kanina na nagtanong.

asr-005319
04:11:22.700 --> 04:11:30.620
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: And he mentioned also na for year 2026 may pondo ang Sorsogon.

asr-005320
04:11:30.620 --> 04:11:41.580
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: Sorsogon-Samar Bridge na 140, if I'm not mistaken, 130 million.

asr-005321
04:11:43.420 --> 04:11:45.240
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: Malaking bagay po talaga ito.

asr-005322
04:11:45.900 --> 04:11:49.280
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: And very excited kami and masaya sa bagong balita na ito.

asr-005323
04:11:49.300 --> 04:11:53.680
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: For year 2027 po ba may ina-appropriate pa rin na pondo para dito?

asr-005324
04:11:53.800 --> 04:12:00.700
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: Or enough na yung 130 million para matapos ang feasibility study?

asr-005325
04:12:02.260 --> 04:12:04.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Feasibility study po muna tayo.

asr-005326
04:12:04.120 --> 04:12:08.320
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Para po ma-pondohan natin ito later on with foreign funding.

asr-005327
04:12:08.320 --> 04:12:11.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero po nag-counterpart funding na rin po tayo.

asr-005328
04:12:11.960 --> 04:12:19.000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ito pong 130 million ay counterpart funding na po natin with the, I think with the ADB, no?

asr-005329
04:12:19.140 --> 04:12:20.680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: With the Asian Development Bank.

asr-005330
04:12:21.100 --> 04:12:24.660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dahil po sila po ang gagawa po nung ating feasibility study.

asr-005331
04:12:25.040 --> 04:12:29.220
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: Ah, nasimula na po ba ito? And ano po yung target na matapos yung study na ito?

asr-005332
04:12:31.760 --> 04:12:32.640
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo, nagsimula na po.

asr-005333
04:12:33.020 --> 04:12:34.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nagsimula na po at hopefully

asr-005334
04:12:34.580 --> 04:12:34.940
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: by

asr-005335
04:12:34.940 --> 04:12:40.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Next year po eh, meron na po tayong ano, gagabas na po yung results nung ating study.

asr-005336
04:12:40.900 --> 04:12:44.960
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: And then we can move on na po to find the funding for it po ba.

asr-005337
04:12:45.300 --> 04:12:46.480
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: Thank you very much, Sec.

asr-005338
04:12:46.800 --> 04:12:55.620
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: Aside po from the Sorsogon-Samar Link Bridge, meron pa po ba tayong ibang popondohan na feasibility study na malaking proyekto?

asr-005339
04:12:56.440 --> 04:13:04.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo, yun naman pong sa Southern Gate itong  Surigao, no, that will now connect the Visayas to Mindanao.

asr-005340
04:13:04.180 --> 04:13:05.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: via

asr-005341
04:13:05.380 --> 04:13:07.420
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: a long-span bridge.

asr-005342
04:13:07.840 --> 04:13:16.160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ah, yun din po ay nag-agat po tayo na 350 million for feasibility study din po.

asr-005343
04:13:16.300 --> 04:13:17.480
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: For year 2027?

asr-005344
04:13:17.620 --> 04:13:18.160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: 2027.

asr-005345
