asr-005503
04:25:10.940 --> 04:25:22.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So mayroong pabuti tayong mga iiyan na kasama na po yung napagana po natin agad na pumping station sa distrito ni Congressman Miro Quimbo sa Marikina yung tumana pumping station.

asr-005504
04:25:23.000 --> 04:25:23.980
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Eh gumagana na po din.

asr-005505
04:25:24.100 --> 04:25:25.180
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Sana botas, di po ba?

asr-005506
04:25:25.360 --> 04:25:27.040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Na botas po, lahat eh gumagana na.

asr-005507
04:25:27.120 --> 04:25:27.560
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ayun.

asr-005508
04:25:27.640 --> 04:25:30.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dati po, marami pong hindi gumagana. Ngayon po, lahat gumagana.

asr-005509
04:25:30.760 --> 04:25:36.240
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Sa hinaba naman na po ng panahon, buti andyan po kayo at naumpisahan na rin yung ayusin.

asr-005510
04:25:36.240 --> 04:25:40.760
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: We hope so na sooner, ma-100% na natin.

asr-005511
04:25:40.760 --> 04:25:45.000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo, pipilitin po natin. Ang problema nga po talaga, uulitin ko po ito, no,

asr-005512
04:25:45.100 --> 04:25:52.240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: konektado po dun sa advokasya ni Congressman Edgar Erice kanina about yung master plan naman para sa basura,

asr-005513
04:25:52.340 --> 04:25:55.900
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ang number one pong nakakasira sa bomba natin, gago na sa NCR,

asr-005514
04:25:56.120 --> 04:25:58.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ay ang paghigop ng basura.

asr-005515
04:25:59.080 --> 04:26:08.840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pagka po ang pump eh nakahigop po po ng mga basuran talagang medyo mahirap pong tanggalin eh nasisira na po ang mga bomba.

asr-005516
04:26:09.400 --> 04:26:10.580
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: So paugit-ugit po yan.

asr-005517
04:26:10.860 --> 04:26:15.900
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: So kailangan nga po talagang pagtuanan din ng pansin natin.

asr-005518
04:26:16.040 --> 04:26:20.880
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Oo, halos taon-taon nagdadasal tayo. Yan na naman ang issue niyan. Sigurado ka ako, bahana naman.

asr-005519
04:26:21.240 --> 04:26:26.620
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Pero at least, minsan po, Mr. Chair, no, Apo-Sekretary, na pag-usapan natin,

asr-005520
04:26:27.440 --> 04:26:35.340
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: May nasabi ho si Undersecretary, Undersecretary natin na uma-attend, ano pangalan nito?

asr-005521
04:26:36.260 --> 04:26:38.020
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Si Apo...

asr-005521-split-2
04:26:38.020 --> 04:26:39.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nick Conti po

asr-005522
04:26:39.780 --> 04:26:42.420
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: hindi, yung isa basta.

asr-005523
04:26:46.160 --> 04:26:46.920
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Undersecretary.

asr-005524
04:26:49.520 --> 04:27:04.720
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Basta napag-usapan yon. Tinanong ko yung total amount na pondo na inuutay-utay ngang ginagawa under OPMO, yung Undersecretary Sidain po, Sidain, yung kaibigan ko na yan, nakalimutan.

asr-005525
04:27:04.720 --> 04:27:19.860
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Under sa UPMO, yung Unified Project Management Office, then kung magkano ba talaga yung amount na puwede nating igayak para at least magkaroon ng solusyon maliban sa mga sapo-sapo, etcetera

asr-005526
04:27:19.860 --> 04:27:26.820
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Ang total amount, kung di nagkakamali, is 200-plus billion pesos. Ano ba masasabi niyo, Undersecretary?

asr-005527
04:27:27.940 --> 04:28:10.200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: I can confirm that po, na yung pong ongoing foreign-assisted natin eh talagang critical po talaga yan, lalong-lalo na po yung ginagawa, matagal na natin ginagawa sa Marikina, and talagang game-changing po yan at napakalaki po ng naitulong yan sa Marikina at sa surrounding area sa eastern zone ng Metro Manila. Hopefully po, by next year po matatapos na rin po tayo. Finally po, doon sa ating foreign-assisted project sa Marikina.

asr-005527-split-1
04:28:10.200 --> 04:28:13.580
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Malaking bagay po. Isa pa po pala, tungkol naman pala ito, maiba ko naman, ito tungkol sa...

asr-005527-split-1-split-2
04:28:13.580 --> 04:28:16.960
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: tungkol naman pala ito, maiba ko naman, ito tungkol sa...

asr-005528
04:28:18.240 --> 04:28:38.380
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Nabasa ko rin rito, gusto po nyo, tungkol dun sa clustering ng school, di ba ngayon ay tuloy-tuloy ang, alam naman natin ang shortage ng classroom, more or less from 160,000 ngayon 150,000 na.

asr-005529
04:28:39.520 --> 04:28:55.160
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Ang gusto po naman natin kasi mapabilis natin na magamit ng mga syudyante, sapagkat nakikita naman po natin kasi, Mr. Chair, Apu, Sekretary, yung mga amphitheater sa mga school ay nagagamit ng halos 6 na section, 7 sections, pero ngayon ay nababawasan na.

asr-005530
04:28:55.320 --> 04:29:03.720
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Ngayon ang tanong po natin, paano ba yung clustering na ginagawa po ngayon by region?

asr-005531
04:29:03.920 --> 04:29:08.360
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kasi may nagparating din na isang malaking problem.

asr-005532
04:29:08.360 --> 04:29:23.540
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Sa isang project na apat na distrito magpagsasama-sama, apos i-implement ng nag-iisa na mayroong, sa isang project na mayroong 57 na sites, ano ho bang masasabi nyo rito? Mas mapapabilis ba siya o ano ho mas maganda?

asr-005533
04:29:23.640 --> 04:29:36.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo, ang ginagawa po natin ngayon, parang nga po naghanap tayo ng mga panibagong paraan para mapabilis ang pagpapagawa ng classroom, meron po tayong ginagawang clustering, pero site per site.

asr-005534
04:29:36.680 --> 04:29:37.460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ibig sabihin po, akimbawa.

asr-005535
04:29:38.300 --> 04:29:41.820
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Meron pong mga site na mahihirap puntahan.

asr-005536
04:29:42.680 --> 04:29:45.660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yun po, ika-cluster po natin doon para masigurado po natin.

asr-005537
04:29:45.660 --> 04:29:50.840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na talaga pong magagawa ng mabilis yung mga areas na yun.

asr-005538
04:29:51.840 --> 04:29:56.740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Importante din po yung clustering dahil po pag nagkoconsolidate po tayo,

asr-005539
04:29:56.780 --> 04:30:03.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: then mas na i-insure po natin yung bilis at yung quality din po ng pagpapagawa.

asr-005540
04:30:03.860 --> 04:30:06.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero depende din po ito sa mga site.

asr-005541
04:30:07.620 --> 04:30:10.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Halimbawa po kung merong mga area na mountainous,

asr-005542
04:30:10.360 --> 04:30:14.920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: halimbawa po sa Cordillera po, dun sa area po ni Congressman Domogan.

asr-005543
04:30:15.100 --> 04:30:16.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yung mga last miles.

asr-005544
04:30:16.300 --> 04:30:16.860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yung mga last miles.

asr-005545
04:30:17.060 --> 04:30:19.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pwede po natin i-cluster yung mga marayong lugar

asr-005546
04:30:19.800 --> 04:30:27.100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: para po mas madaling maabot ng mga kontratista yung mga area at sanay sa lugar.

asr-005547
04:30:27.560 --> 04:30:33.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So very ano naman po ito, very, wala naman pong hard and fast na rule dito

asr-005548
04:30:33.260 --> 04:30:40.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: at nag-a-adjust lang po tayo with the end goal na mapabilis at ma-insure na maayos ang pagkagawa.

asr-005549
04:30:40.160 --> 04:30:42.360
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: At saka magamit po agad ng ating mga…

asr-005550
04:30:42.360 --> 04:30:43.460
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: At magagamit po agad ng ating mga…

asr-005551
04:30:43.460 --> 04:30:44.700
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kasi yun po usually.

asr-005552
04:30:44.700 --> 04:30:45.920
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Nagiging problema po.

asr-005554
04:30:46.200 --> 04:30:48.800
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Sana matignan nyo, ma-revisit nyo lang po, Aposagatari.

asr-005556
04:30:49.740 --> 04:30:50.680
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Last question.

asr-005557
04:30:50.680 --> 04:30:51.800
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Ito na po, Aposagatari.

asr-005558
04:30:54.940 --> 04:30:58.100
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Ito, napag-usapan po natin parate na tungkol po dun sa repair,

asr-005559
04:30:58.720 --> 04:31:02.360
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: tungkol sa constructions, ng maharlika natin, yung daan 001,

asr-005560
04:31:03.120 --> 04:31:05.060
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: at saka yung mga iba pa po.

asr-005561
04:31:05.980 --> 04:31:09.320
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Ang isa po sa hindi po natin napapansin, Mr. Chair, Aposagatari,

asr-005562
04:31:11.060 --> 04:31:13.040
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: tungkol po dun sa mga overloading,

asr-005563
04:31:14.440 --> 04:31:17.880
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: eh, ang totoo niya, kahit gaano kalalim po yung gawin natin,

asr-005564
04:31:17.920 --> 04:31:21.120
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: gaano kakapal ka ko sana yung mga 311 natin na yan,

asr-005565
04:31:22.060 --> 04:31:24.840
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: PCCP natin na yan, eh, wala pong mangyayari dyan.

asr-005566
04:31:25.640 --> 04:31:29.400
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Eh, hindi po ba, andyan naman yung mga track scale natin, wing scale natin,

asr-005567
04:31:29.420 --> 04:31:36.100
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: na ang may saklaw dyan, dapat PMP, DPWH, at saka LTO.

asr-005568
04:31:36.340 --> 04:31:42.200
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Ang tanong po dyan, ilan na po ba yung medyo na…

asr-005569
04:31:43.000 --> 04:31:46.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nabigyan po natin ng pansin, Mr. Chair, Aposagatari.

asr-005570
04:31:48.160 --> 04:31:51.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi sira po kasi ng sirekal sa atin, tapos repair naman tayo ng repair.

asr-005571
04:31:51.780 --> 04:31:53.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Di ba magastos, di po ba?

asr-005572
04:31:54.060 --> 04:31:56.860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Maraking problema po talaga ito, Mr. Chairman.

asr-005573
04:31:57.060 --> 04:32:00.760
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: In fact, nung ako po yung nasa Department of Transportation pa,

asr-005574
04:32:00.920 --> 04:32:04.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: talaga pong sakit ng ulo po ito,

asr-005575
04:32:04.300 --> 04:32:09.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: dahil it's really a big enforcement problem.

asr-005576
04:32:11.120 --> 04:32:11.920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Iyan â€™yung po.

asr-005577
04:32:11.920 --> 04:32:13.920
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At tuloy-tuloy po ang pagdulog natin.

asr-005578
04:32:13.920 --> 04:32:18.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kay Secretary Janvic, kay Chief PNP, at sa ating mga LGUs

asr-005579
04:32:18.480 --> 04:32:23.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na talaga mag-impose po tayo ng strict enforcement nung ating overloading.

asr-005580
04:32:23.540 --> 04:32:24.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Grabe po talaga.

asr-005581
04:32:24.340 --> 04:32:28.580
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mr. Chairman, sasabihin ko lang po, si Congressman Tan po,

asr-005582
04:32:28.580 --> 04:32:31.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: taga Isabela at sa Northern Luzon,

asr-005583
04:32:31.920 --> 04:32:35.840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Diyos ko po, yung pong ating mga tulay dyan, number one victim po

asr-005584
04:32:35.840 --> 04:32:38.160
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ng mga overloaded na track.

asr-005585
04:32:39.320 --> 04:32:42.500
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Talaga pong kailangan po talaga ma-enforce natin ang mabuti.

asr-005586
04:32:42.520 --> 04:32:44.000
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Mga 60 tons nga yun, Secretary.

asr-005587
04:32:44.440 --> 04:32:45.840
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Minsan po, 100 tons.

asr-005588
04:32:46.160 --> 04:32:48.600
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Yung pong sumira sa pigatan sa kagayaan.

asr-005589
04:32:48.600 --> 04:32:51.440
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Parang 80 to 100 tons po yun, na dalawa.

asr-005590
04:32:51.900 --> 04:32:52.380
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Opo.

asr-005591
04:32:52.620 --> 04:32:56.560
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kaya yun ho, kaya sana ay ma-impose natin,

asr-005592
04:32:56.680 --> 04:32:59.180
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: strictly ma-impose natin para at least

asr-005593
04:33:01.100 --> 04:33:02.980
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: ma-protectionan natin yung kalasada natin.

asr-005594
04:33:02.980 --> 04:33:06.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo. Dudulog po tayo sa ating law enforcement agencies

asr-005595
04:33:06.800 --> 04:33:07.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: para po magtulog natin.

asr-005596
04:33:07.560 --> 04:33:11.160
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Para at least, hindi masayang ang pera ng taong bayan.

asr-005597
04:33:11.160 --> 04:33:12.520
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Kahit anong gawin natin,

asr-005598
04:33:12.520 --> 04:33:15.780
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: kahit anong perang i-gastusin natin,

asr-005599
04:33:15.780 --> 04:33:20.700
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: kung di ho natin naman talaga i-limit yung load ng mga sasakyan.

asr-005600
04:33:20.840 --> 04:33:22.280
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: At sasak natin masisira natin.

asr-005601
04:33:22.840 --> 04:33:24.300
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Again and again, Sal, thank you po.

asr-005602
04:33:24.660 --> 04:33:27.620
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: Maraming salamat sa tulong ng DPT Palit sa atin

asr-005603
04:33:27.620 --> 04:33:29.300
Rep. Joseph S. Tan: at sa ating lahat. Maraming maraming salamat.

asr-005604
04:33:30.040 --> 04:33:33.600
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, Com. Joseph, for the very short questions.

asr-005605
04:33:36.140 --> 04:33:37.820
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Pero ang galing, ang galing ng mga tanong.

asr-005606
04:33:38.280 --> 04:33:39.800
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Actually, very interesting.

asr-005607
04:33:42.020 --> 04:33:42.540
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Secretary,

asr-005608
04:33:42.540 --> 04:33:44.540
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: malapit na. Malapit na tayong matapos.

asr-005609
04:33:45.140 --> 04:33:45.860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Okay lang po.

asr-005610
04:33:46.720 --> 04:33:48.480
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Kung hindi, magdadagdagan ito.

asr-005611
04:33:49.380 --> 04:33:54.840
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Well, the next, the next to interpellate,

asr-005612
04:33:54.840 --> 04:33:58.820
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: our senior deputy speaker, Dinan Hernandez.

asr-005613
04:33:59.500 --> 04:34:01.820
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Thank you, Mr. Chair. Hindi po ako magtatanong.

asr-005614
04:34:01.820 --> 04:34:04.100
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Kaya lang sa tagal ng tanong ni Kong Joseph,

asr-005615
04:34:04.100 --> 04:34:05.860
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: kala ko telenovela eh.

asr-005616
04:34:06.580 --> 04:34:09.820
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: So, actually, nandito lang po ako para magpasalamat,

asr-005617
04:34:10.240 --> 04:34:13.640
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: i-congratulate si Secretary Vince under his watch.

asr-005618
04:34:14.270 --> 04:34:16.220
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Hindi po biro yung pinagdaanan ninyo.

asr-005619
04:34:16.510 --> 04:34:18.720
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: So, palakpakan niyo po yung mga sarili ninyo.

asr-005620
04:34:18.960 --> 04:34:21.980
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: DPWH, you deserve a round of applause.

asr-005621
04:34:23.640 --> 04:34:29.720
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Kasi, ah, I was thinking nung nag-umpisa si Sec. Vince,

asr-005622
04:34:29.800 --> 04:34:31.940
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: napakahirap nung pagdadaanan niya.

asr-005623
04:34:32.740 --> 04:34:35.680
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Whether ma-accept ng buong DP institution,

asr-005624
04:34:35.680 --> 04:34:37.400
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: the reforms that he introduced,

asr-005626
04:34:39.380 --> 04:34:41.400
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: galing din po ako sa gobyerno.

asr-005627
04:34:42.280 --> 04:34:43.660
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: It's so hard to introduce reforms.

asr-005628
04:34:43.980 --> 04:34:49.800
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: But, ah, I must say na at this time, medyo the dust settle.

asr-005629
04:34:50.220 --> 04:34:52.360
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Medyo tanggap na po yung mga reforms.

asr-005630
04:34:52.760 --> 04:34:55.200
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Tuloy-tuloy na yung trabaho ng DPWH.

asr-005631
04:34:55.200 --> 04:34:59.840
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: And then, ah, si Mr. Actionman, no?

asr-005632
04:35:00.450 --> 04:35:02.360
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Mr. Actionman na tawag natin kay Sec. Vince.

asr-005633
04:35:03.760 --> 04:35:08.340
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: O kaya huwag kayong magtataka na mas mukha siyang matanda sa akin.

asr-005634
04:35:09.270 --> 04:35:11.440
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Mas bata ho ako. Mas bata ho siya sa akin.

asr-005635
04:35:11.580 --> 04:35:13.320
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Pero dahil sa kakaikot niya.

asr-005636
04:35:13.580 --> 04:35:17.760
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Actually, pag pinapanood ko siya, parang nakikita ko na yung sitwasyon ng buong Pilipinas.

asr-005637
04:35:18.900 --> 04:35:20.740
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: And, hindi, sa totoo lang to, no?

asr-005638
04:35:22.360 --> 04:35:25.540
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Ah, binibisita niya yung mga lugar na hopeless.

asr-005639
04:35:26.720 --> 04:35:28.540
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Pero nagagawa ng paraan.

asr-005640
04:35:28.540 --> 04:35:30.900
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Ibig sabihin, walang perang nasasayang.

asr-005641
04:35:31.380 --> 04:35:33.640
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Witness po ako niyan doon sa lugar ko, no?

asr-005642
04:35:35.400 --> 04:35:37.960
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Ah, used to be my district. Nasira yung daan.

asr-005643
04:35:39.560 --> 04:35:40.800
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Eh, niyaya po niya akong lumipad.

asr-005644
04:35:41.040 --> 04:35:44.420
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: So, sinamaan ko po siya at nakita ko yung, nakita niya yung lugar.

asr-005645
04:35:44.760 --> 04:35:46.060
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Talagang in action, no?

asr-005646
04:35:46.900 --> 04:35:50.420
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Dinala ko siya doon sa ibang lugar na kailangan tapusin.

asr-005647
04:35:54.280 --> 04:35:56.480
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Ah, fortunately, ah, nabigyan niya naman ng pondo na

asr-005648
04:35:56.480 --> 04:36:02.660
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: he made sure na yung mga nabisita niya at kailangang ayusin, naiayos, no?

asr-005649
04:36:03.060 --> 04:36:05.220
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: So I'll give it to Sec. Vince,

asr-005650
04:36:05.220 --> 04:36:08.660
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: na sana tuloy-tuloy na ito.

asr-005651
04:36:08.760 --> 04:36:13.400
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: At alam ko naman, under your watch, wala nang perang masasayang.

asr-005652
04:36:13.440 --> 04:36:16.020
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Wala nang ghost project, wala nang substandard.

asr-005653
04:36:16.460 --> 04:36:27.660
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Everybody now is aware na ang publiko ay talagang nagbabantay na bawat piso na mapupunta sa DP ay pakikinabangan ng taong bayan.

asr-005654
04:36:27.700 --> 04:36:31.260
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: And I'm, ako mismo, I'm confident, no?

asr-005655
04:36:31.380 --> 04:36:34.360
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Hindi lang naman ako, maraming namang nakaka-witness dyan.

asr-005656
04:36:34.820 --> 04:36:36.400
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Na, ah, pasensya ka na, Sec. Vince.

asr-005657
04:36:37.220 --> 04:36:41.480
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Tuwing budget, feeling ng lahat, savior of the universe ka.

asr-005658
04:36:42.000 --> 04:36:44.560
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Pero alam naman natin, hindi naman kaya ang lahat.

asr-005659
04:36:44.840 --> 04:36:54.480
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Doon lang sa talagang, ah, tama, practical, reasonable, and, ah, napaka-importanting project na pakinabagan ng taong bayan.

asr-005660
04:36:54.580 --> 04:36:57.700
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: So, again, congratulations to the DP family.

asr-005661
04:36:58.540 --> 04:37:01.020
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Ah, I hope you continue all these reforms.

asr-005662
04:37:01.020 --> 04:37:03.140
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: And, ah, mapakita sa publiko na,

asr-005663
04:37:03.140 --> 04:37:07.800
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: karapat-dapat na pagkatiwalaan ang Department of Public Works and Highways.

asr-005664
04:37:07.960 --> 04:37:08.560
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Maraming salamat.

asr-005665
04:37:12.460 --> 04:37:14.020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ah, Mr. Chairman, maraming...

asr-005666
04:37:14.140 --> 04:37:20.700
Senior Deputy Speaker Ferdinand L. Hernandez: Bago ko pala i-end yung speech ko, nagpapasalamat ako at sana huwag mo kalimutan ang distrito ko.

asr-005667
04:37:21.840 --> 04:37:26.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo. Ah, Mr. Chairman, papasalamat po ako kay, ah, Senior Deputy Speaker.

asr-005668
04:37:26.780 --> 04:37:33.400
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Ah, basta po, with, with your support po, and, ah, lalong-lalo na po ang supporta ng Pangulo.

asr-005669
04:37:33.540 --> 04:37:35.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Basta po, tuloy-tuloy po tayo.

asr-005670
04:37:35.980 --> 04:37:37.660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Habang buhay. Habang buhay po.

asr-005671
04:37:37.780 --> 04:37:38.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Tuloy-tuloy tayo.

asr-005672
04:37:39.540 --> 04:37:41.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you, SDS Dinan.

asr-005673
04:37:42.780 --> 04:37:46.340
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Next, ah, Congressman Timothy Cayton.

asr-005674
04:37:47.820 --> 04:37:49.880
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Thank you so much, ah, Mr. Chairman.

asr-005675
04:37:50.860 --> 04:37:54.660
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: I'll, I'll just make it, ah, short for our Secretary.

asr-005676
04:37:54.660 --> 04:38:03.820
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: But, ah, before I begin, may commend the Department, once again, for the reforms na introduced,

asr-005677
04:38:03.820 --> 04:38:06.820
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: especially, ah, the flood mitigation programs.

asr-005678
04:38:06.820 --> 04:38:09.060
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: May saludo ko kami sa Departamento ho talaga.

asr-005679
04:38:09.060 --> 04:38:13.060
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Ako yung Congressman ng probinsya ng Nueva Vizcaya.

asr-005680
04:38:13.060 --> 04:38:18.260
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: And, ah, Nueva Vizcaya is known as the gateway of the Cagayan Valley

asr-005681
04:38:18.880 --> 04:38:24.680
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Alam mo ninyo, the last budget deliberation, may request ho kami ng widening ng national roads.

asr-005682
04:38:24.840 --> 04:38:29.220
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: At ongoing na ho siya. Thank you so much, ah, ah, Secretary, ah, ah, Vince.

asr-005683
04:38:31.200 --> 04:38:35.700
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: But then, ah, our, ah, problem now.

asr-005684
04:38:35.700 --> 04:38:47.080
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Is, ah, yun hung, ah, location kasi yun ng Nueva Vizcaya talagang, ah, marami hung cargo trucks.

asr-005685
04:38:48.360 --> 04:38:49.960
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Yeah, marami hung cargo trucks.

asr-005686
04:38:49.960 --> 04:38:51.740
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: All through the region, ah, region.

asr-005687
04:38:52.600 --> 04:38:56.100
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Ah, we know the movement of goods is important to the economy.

asr-005688
04:38:56.100 --> 04:39:00.600
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: And continuous passage of heavy and potentially overloaded trucks.

asr-005689
04:39:01.300 --> 04:39:04.780
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Also contributes to the premature deterioration.

asr-005690
04:39:04.780 --> 04:39:06.680
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: And wear and tear of our roads and bridges.

asr-005691
04:39:07.820 --> 04:39:11.280
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Now, ah, ah, the way the public would see.

asr-005692
04:39:11.520 --> 04:39:17.020
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Dahil hung, ah, ah, dahil sa mga overloads, yung mga trucks natin, overloading.

asr-005693
04:39:17.480 --> 04:39:20.660
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Eh, makikita ng publiko na para ang bilis na masira yung roads.

asr-005694
04:39:21.180 --> 04:39:26.760
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: And they would have the public opinion that's, ah, dahil ang bilis, is substandard.

asr-005695
04:39:26.800 --> 04:39:29.760
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Eh, ang cause pala nito is the overloading ng mga trucks.

asr-005696
04:39:29.760 --> 04:39:33.480
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: May we know now, Secretary, kung what possible...

asr-005697
04:39:33.480 --> 04:39:39.400
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Ah, DPWH, ah, executive action ang gagawin nun natin.

asr-005698
04:39:39.440 --> 04:39:47.540
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Taking into account, siyempre, yung Republic Act 8794 on the Anti-Overloading Law or Motor Vehicle Users' Charge Act.

asr-005699
04:39:50.700 --> 04:39:55.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mr. Chairman, no, ah, ah, like I said po kanina, no.

asr-005700
04:39:55.640 --> 04:40:01.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Talagang, nung DOTR pa lang po ako, talagang, grabe na pong problema ito, no, itong overloading, no.

asr-005701
04:40:01.600 --> 04:40:04.240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At, ah, lalo ko pong nakita ito nung, ah, nung, ah...

asr-005702
04:40:04.240 --> 04:40:08.260
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: na ako'y napasok po sa DPWH.

asr-005703
04:40:08.480 --> 04:40:11.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Dahil po yung ating N1, yung Maharlika.

asr-005704
04:40:12.480 --> 04:40:16.680
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Talaga pong yan po ang laging nasisira dahil sa overloading, no.

asr-005705
04:40:16.880 --> 04:40:19.700
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At hindi lang po yung Maharlika, kundi po yung mga tulay po natin.

asr-005706
04:40:20.680 --> 04:40:22.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: No, na, nasabi nga din po ni Kong Joseph.

asr-005707
04:40:22.380 --> 04:40:26.740
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At, ah, ako po ay talagang ano, no, tuloy-tuloy po ang pagdulog ko.

asr-005708
04:40:26.740 --> 04:40:32.060
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At, ah, ah, para po ma-enforce na po natin talaga itong anti-overloading natin, no.

asr-005709
04:40:32.900 --> 04:40:34.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi po talagang ano, eh, kailangan...

asr-005711
04:40:35.500 --> 04:40:40.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi kung hindi po natin gagawin ito, talagang paulit-ulit lang po tayong mag-aayos ng kalye

asr-005713
04:40:40.140 --> 04:40:42.100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At paulit-ulit pong masisira.

asr-005714
04:40:42.100 --> 04:40:44.620
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At ang problema po talaga dyan, ang tulay.

asr-005715
04:40:44.740 --> 04:40:48.340
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kasi po, ang tulay eh nasira at naputol.

asr-005716
04:40:49.260 --> 04:40:51.100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Eh, talagang grabe po ang perwisyo niyan.

asr-005717
04:40:51.100 --> 04:40:54.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At bago po yan maayos, eh napakatagal po.

asr-005718
04:40:54.300 --> 04:40:59.720
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Buwan po ang bibigangin, minsan taon ang bibigangin bago maayos ang mga tulay.

asr-005719
04:40:59.720 --> 04:41:03.240
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Kaya po, ah, kaisa niyo po ako, ah, ah, Kong.

asr-005720
04:41:03.240 --> 04:41:04.380
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At, ah...

asr-005721
04:41:04.380 --> 04:41:10.140
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: I will do my best po para, ah, ma-push po natin ang, ah, magtulungan po ang ating law enforcement

asr-005722
04:41:10.140 --> 04:41:14.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: para talagang ma-enforce natin ang ating anti-overloading, ah, regulations.

asr-005723
04:41:15.380 --> 04:41:18.960
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Thank you so much, ah, ah, Sec. Vince.

asr-005724
04:41:19.060 --> 04:41:28.140
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: I'm, I'm sure under your leadership, eh, lalo hong nating, ah, mapapaiting itong, ah, implementation ng anti-overloading law.

asr-005725
04:41:28.400 --> 04:41:33.240
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: And, ah, if possible, siguro, pwede ho nating, ah, malagyan o...

asr-005726
04:41:33.240 --> 04:41:38.000
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Ah, ah, sa additional weighing facilities dun sa area.

asr-005727
04:41:38.000 --> 04:41:45.180
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Ah, kung pwede ho malagyan tong para ma-streaker implementation nung matas ko natin.

asr-005728
04:41:45.180 --> 04:41:51.460
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo. In fact, marami po tayong pinapabiging mga weighing scale na dagdag para po makapag-deploy tayo sa iba't ibang region.

asr-005729
04:41:52.105 --> 04:41:52.325
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Yes thank you

asr-005730
04:41:52.325 --> 04:41:53.540
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Mr. Chairman.

asr-005731
04:41:53.740 --> 04:41:55.160
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Isa ho sana sa Nueva Vizcaya.

asr-005732
04:41:55.360 --> 04:41:56.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo. Magpapadala po tayo. Opo.

asr-005733
04:41:59.720 --> 04:42:01.040
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Meron, meron daw po. Papadala po

asr-005735
04:42:01.040 --> 04:42:03.600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ng ating bagong regional director sa region.

asr-005736
04:42:03.900 --> 04:42:06.620
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Okay. Second, ah, ah, Sec.

asr-005737
04:42:07.200 --> 04:42:11.760
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Ah, Nueva Vizcaya, it's, ah, it composes 15 municipalities.

asr-005738
04:42:12.360 --> 04:42:14.000
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Some are geographically isolated.

asr-005739
04:42:14.580 --> 04:42:17.460
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Agricultural communities, kailangan ho ng mga bridges.

asr-005740
04:42:17.940 --> 04:42:19.660
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Ah, I would understand.

asr-005741
04:42:20.040 --> 04:42:21.900
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Na-limited ho yung pondo natin.

asr-005742
04:42:22.340 --> 04:42:27.860
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Eh, yun ho sa construction of bridges, ah, is it possible na by phasing or multi-year nang gagawin natin?

asr-005743
04:42:28.080 --> 04:42:29.680
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: O pwede hong minsanan na lang?

asr-005744
04:42:29.680 --> 04:42:31.480
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Opo. Ito pong mga bridges.

asr-005745
04:42:31.660 --> 04:42:40.000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Unfortunately po, no, kahit gusto po natin ang minsanan, eh, medyo unang-una marami pong tayong bridges na kailangan ayusin.

asr-005746
04:42:40.000 --> 04:42:43.500
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At medyo mahaba din po ang pagsasayos.

asr-005747
04:42:43.620 --> 04:42:45.660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Gumagampas po madalas ng isang taon yan.

asr-005748
04:42:45.660 --> 04:42:49.020
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: So, ang suggestion po natin moving forward from 2027,

asr-005749
04:42:49.020 --> 04:42:54.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: imbes na po phasing, eh mag multi-year appropriation lang po tayo.

asr-005751
04:42:55.260 --> 04:42:58.840
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Para kung meron po tayong simulang i-rehabilitate na tulay,

asr-005752
04:42:59.480 --> 04:43:05.860
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: siguraduhin po natin na yung succeeding years mapondohan para po alam natin kung kailan matatapos.

asr-005754
04:43:05.880 --> 04:43:09.100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At masigurado po ang pondo sa mga susunod na taon.

asr-005756
04:43:09.180 --> 04:43:11.460
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Thank you so much for making that clear.

asr-005757
04:43:11.460 --> 04:43:13.060
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: And lastly, eh, request na lang.

asr-005758
04:43:13.060 --> 04:43:14.480
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Anyway, nandito si RD.

asr-005759
04:43:15.180 --> 04:43:22.280
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Ah, request namin if, ah, for the construction of pedestrian overpass within the Maharlika Highway.

asr-005760
04:43:22.280 --> 04:43:26.760
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: And may request na ho kami last time. May pondo na ho for the implementation this year.

asr-005761
04:43:26.760 --> 04:43:32.620
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: And for next year, kung pwede ho, is only, ah, ah, two more pedestrian overpass

asr-005762
04:43:32.620 --> 04:43:42.060
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: because, ah, there are incidents of, ah, accidents and safety risks within the area dito sa National Highway in Bonfal East Bayumbong

asr-005763
04:43:42.940 --> 04:43:46.140
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: and at the same time in Barangay Balete

asr-005764
04:43:47.260 --> 04:43:51.140
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Eh, I will just, ah, submit din sa the necessary documents before the Regional Director.

asr-005765
04:43:51.380 --> 04:43:52.620
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Maraming salamat, ah, sir.

asr-005766
04:43:52.780 --> 04:43:53.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Please po, Mr. Chairman,

asr-005768
04:43:53.860 --> 04:43:55.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Cong, i-submit lang po at

asr-005769
04:43:56.260 --> 04:43:58.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Nandito po si RD natin, ah. Pupunta po siya sayo.

asr-005770
04:43:58.560 --> 04:43:59.280
Rep. Timothy Joseph E. Cayton: Thank you so much.

asr-005771
04:43:59.580 --> 04:44:00.160
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Thank you.

asr-005772
04:44:01.440 --> 04:44:01.920
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Ah, next.

asr-005773
04:44:04.240 --> 04:44:07.460
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Ah, to interpellate is the Chairman of the Committee on Ways and Means.

asr-005774
04:44:07.800 --> 04:44:09.440
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Yung hanap ng pera para sa atin.

asr-005775
04:44:09.440 --> 04:44:13.620
Rep. Romeo S. Momo Sr.: Congressman Miro Quimbo.

asr-005776
04:44:14.500 --> 04:44:18.020
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Ah, maraming salamat, ah, Congressman Momo.

asr-005777
04:44:18.020 --> 04:44:22.380
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Ang chairman po ng Public Works dito.

asr-005778
04:44:22.380 --> 04:44:24.660
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Na hanggang sa araw na po ito ay, ah,

asr-005779
04:44:24.660 --> 04:44:31.560
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: sa kasaysayan ng DPWH ay yung naging pinakamagandang lalaking naging USEC ng DPWH.

asr-005780
04:44:31.560 --> 04:44:33.280
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Agree ba kayo?

asr-005781
04:44:33.980 --> 04:44:36.680
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Oo, parang lahat ng mga tao doon agree, ah.

asr-005782
04:44:36.680 --> 04:44:38.340
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Mukhang marami ka pang bata dito.

asr-005783
04:44:38.340 --> 04:44:39.740
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: USEC Momo, ah.

asr-005784
04:44:40.180 --> 04:44:40.700
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Okay.

asr-005785
04:44:42.480 --> 04:44:45.580
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Ah, bagamat gustong gusto ko po, ah, purihin talaga ang DPWH.

asr-005787
04:44:47.000 --> 04:44:48.820
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: bayaan ko na muna iba ang gumawa niya

asr-005788
04:44:48.820 --> 04:44:49.280
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: kasi total,

asr-005789
04:44:50.380 --> 04:44:52.060
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: nag-uumapaw na ang papuri.

asr-005790
04:44:52.560 --> 04:44:54.200
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Pero para sa akin nilang,

asr-005791
04:44:54.200 --> 04:44:56.120
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Secretary Vince,

asr-005792
04:44:57.280 --> 04:44:58.920
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: pinag-usapan na naman natin

asr-005793
04:44:58.920 --> 04:45:00.640
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: is that we just want it on record,

asr-005794
04:45:01.300 --> 04:45:01.940
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: yung commitment natin,

asr-005795
04:45:02.080 --> 04:45:05.560
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: yung ating mga flood control sa Marikina,

asr-005796
04:45:05.560 --> 04:45:08.040
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: particularly yung dalawang pumping stations,

asr-005797
04:45:08.040 --> 04:45:12.240
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: ay patuloy na sisiguraduhin

asr-005798
04:45:12.240 --> 04:45:14.860
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: na ito ay magiging kapakipakinabang

asr-005799
04:45:14.860 --> 04:45:17.160
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: para sa mga taga-Marikina.

asr-005800
04:45:17.160 --> 04:45:18.540
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Do we have that commitment,

asr-005801
04:45:18.740 --> 04:45:19.400
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Mr. Secretary?

asr-005802
04:45:19.580 --> 04:45:19.880
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Yes po.

asr-005803
04:45:19.980 --> 04:45:23.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: At ibibigti po natin si Director Jerry Pano

asr-005804
04:45:23.520 --> 04:45:25.600
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kung masira po yan ulit.

asr-005805
04:45:25.600 --> 04:45:27.200
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Pero at the same time po,

asr-005806
04:45:27.220 --> 04:45:28.800
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: kidding aside, Mr. Chairman,

asr-005807
04:45:28.960 --> 04:45:31.280
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: Congressman Miro,

asr-005808
04:45:31.280 --> 04:45:34.120
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: is aparte po dun sa

asr-005809
04:45:34.120 --> 04:45:37.300
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: pagsisigurado na mamaintain natin

asr-005810
04:45:37.300 --> 04:45:39.100
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ang tama yung mga pumping stations natin,

asr-005811
04:45:39.100 --> 04:45:41.780
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ang commitment din po natin sa Marikina,

asr-005812
04:45:41.780 --> 04:45:43.000
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: dahil napaka-critical po

asr-005813
04:45:43.260 --> 04:45:45.520
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: ng inyong syudad at distrito.

asr-005814
04:45:45.760 --> 04:45:47.660
DPWH Secretary Vivencio B. Dizon: E gari pong may nakastandby dyan

